{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01C4XVJeLBdu5WP96oa8EK9F","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '原始 framing 完全成立。论文叙事以跨架构 routing 一致性为核心：C2 三层级路由梯度（VLM→OXE-VLA→task-VLA）作为\n2\t  headline finding， R² exit collapse 的 VLM→VLA 二元分离（6/6 vs 0/4）作为 mechanistic insight，NLP\n3\t  finetuning control（ΔR²=0.000） 作为 specificity evidence。C1 框架的跨架构可复用性被独立 valued。C3\n4\t  作为 RSA-qualified observation 不受挑战。 Reviewers 在 best 档接受：(1) 3架构×4suite 矩阵为充分覆盖，(2)\n5\t  Δ>0.10 阈值非 arbitrary， (3) CF metric incomparability 被 properly caveated 后不成为 dealbreaker，(4)\n6\t  无 closed-loop 验证不 fatal， (5) L1 head count base-model-dependent 解读被视为 honest science。\n7\t\n8\t  '\n9\timagined_experiments:\n10\t- name: SigLIP+Projector RSA vs Full VLA vs DINO\n11\t  plan_id: plan_001\n12\t  description: 提取 frozen SigLIP+projector 的 4096d 输出，计算 RSA 对齐度，与 VLA 各层和 standalone\n13\t    DINO 对比\n14\t  expected_results:\n15\t    siglip_projector_rsa: 0.615\n16\t    bootstrap_95_ci:\n17\t    - 0.526\n18\t    - 0.695\n19\t    trained_vla_peak_rsa: 0.488\n20\t    untrained_vla_peak_rsa: 0.485\n21\t    dino_rsa: 0.388\n22\t    llm_degradation_delta: -0.127\n23\t  result_rationale: '在 best 档下，SigLIP+projector RSA=0.615 远高于 VLA 任何层（~0.49）和 DINO（0.388），\n24\t    reviewers 接受这一证据说明 action-relevant geometric structure 的主要来源是 frozen vision encoder。\n25\t    LLM 降解 0.127 的 gap 被解读为 LLM 在保持 action structure 的同时重分配信息用于 instruction routing——\n26\t    这不是损失而是 functional trade-off。reviewer 不会要求 unfrozen encoder 对照实验， 因为 frozen encoder\n27\t    是三种 VLA 架构的共同设计选择，实验覆盖了实际部署的设计空间。\n28\t\n29\t    '\n30\t  tables:\n31\t  - title: 'Action-Aligned Geometry: Source Localization'\n32\t    columns:\n33\t    - Representation\n34\t    - RSA (ρ)\n35\t    - 95% CI\n36\t    - vs DINO Δ\n37\t    rows:\n38\t    - - SigLIP+Projector (4096d)\n39\t      - '0.615'\n40\t      - '[0.526, 0.695]'\n41\t      - '+0.227'\n42\t    - - VLA Trained peak (L9)\n43\t      - '0.488'\n44\t      - '[0.41, 0.56]'\n45\t      - '+0.100'\n46\t    - - VLA Untrained peak (L12)\n47\t      - '0.485'\n48\t      - '[0.40, 0.56]'\n49\t      - '+0.097'\n50\t    - - DINOv2 cls_token\n51\t      - '0.388'\n52\t      - '[0.30, 0.47]'\n53\t      - —\n54\t  figures_description:\n55\t  - 'Bar chart: four representations ordered by RSA magnitude, with 95% CI error bars.\n56\t    SigLIP+Proj visually dominant.'\n57\t  analysis: 'Vision encoder 提供 RSA=0.615 的 action-relevant structure，LLM 层将其降至 ~0.49。\n58\t    四条件（trained/untrained × with/without inst）在 0.48-0.49 band 内收敛，说明 LLM 降解幅度与训练状态和\n59\t    instruction 存在与否无关。在 best 档下，这一结果为 C1 框架 提供了定量基础：framework 正确识别了 vision encoder\n60\t    作为 action geometry 的 source。\n61\t\n62\t    '\n63\t- name: DINOv2 Baseline RSA\n64\t  plan_id: plan_002\n65\t  description: 提取 standalone DINOv2 ViT-L/14 cls_token 和 patch_mean，作为 non-VL vision\n66\t    model 基准\n67\t  expected_results:\n68\t    dino_cls_rsa: 0.692\n69\t    dino_patch_mean_rsa: 0.631\n70\t    dino_action_probe_R2: 0.687\n71\t    temporal_rho_per_task_mean: 0.901\n72\t    subtask_macro_auc: 0.972\n73\t    control_b_permutation_rho: 0.039\n74\t  result_rationale: 'DINOv2 cls_token RSA=0.692 是所有 standalone encoder 中最高的（under\n75\t    RSA metric）， 这为 C3 observation 提供基础——DINOv2 的 self-supervised 预训练产生了最高的 geometric  alignment。在\n76\t    best 档下，reviewers 接受 \"under RSA\" qualifier，不要求 CKA 一致性， 因为 RSA 和 CKA 捕捉不同 representational\n77\t    property 的观点被视为 metric-aware honest reporting。 DINOv2 action probe R²=0.687 作为\n78\t    functional baseline 确认 cls_token 的 action-decodability。 label permutation control\n79\t    ρ=0.039 ≈ 0 排除了 probe overfitting。\n80\t\n81\t    '\n82\t  tables:\n83\t  - title: DINOv2 Standalone Baselines\n84\t    columns:\n85\t    - Feature\n86\t    - RSA (ρ)\n87\t    - Action R²\n88\t    - Temporal ρ\n89\t    rows:\n90\t    - - DINOv2 cls_token\n91\t      - '0.692'\n92\t      - '0.687'\n93\t      - '0.901'\n94\t    - - DINOv2 patch_mean\n95\t      - '0.631'\n96\t      - —\n97\t      - —\n98\t    - - Label-permuted control\n99\t      - —\n100\t      - '-0.052'\n101\t      - '0.039'\n102\t  figures_description:\n103\t  - DINOv2 作为 RSA ordering 的 anchor point 出现在 cross-encoder comparison table 中\n104\t  analysis: 'DINOv2 RSA=0.692 > SigLIP+Proj=0.615 > VLA layers ~0.49 > CLIP=0.557。\n105\t    在 best 档下，DINOv2 在 RSA 下的最高排名被 properly qualified， 不会被 reviewer 攻击为 overclaimed。\n106\t\n107\t    '\n108\t- name: Per-layer RSA Curve\n109\t  plan_id: plan_003\n110\t  description: 33 层 × 4 条件（trained/untrained × with/without inst）的 RSA 逐层曲线\n111\t  expected_results:\n112\t    trained_image_mean:\n113\t      peak_layer: 12\n114\t      peak_rsa: 0.628\n115\t      L0_rsa: 0.612\n116\t      L32_rsa: 0.422\n117\t      pattern: inverted-U\n118\t    untrained_image_mean:\n119\t      peak_layer: 0\n120\t      peak_rsa: 0.612\n121\t      L32_rsa: 0.545\n122\t      pattern: monotonic_decay\n123\t    projector_to_L1_drop: 0.204\n124\t    training_shifts_peak: L0 → L12\n125\t  result_rationale: 'Trained image_mean 展现 inverted-U（L0=0.612→L12=0.628 peak→L32=0.422），\n126\t    而 untrained 单调衰减（L0=0.612→L32=0.545）。在 best 档下，reviewers 接受： (1) training 将 RSA\n127\t    peak 从 L0 移到 L12——对应 mid-layer processing 的 VLM 预训练模式； (2) exit 层的 RSA 陡降（trained\n128\t    L32=0.422 vs untrained L32=0.545）与 R² exit collapse  在 direction 上一致；(3) Proj→L1\n129\t    是最大 drop（~0.20），因为 token mixing 在第一个  transformer layer 就开始了。这一 per-layer profile\n130\t    为 C2 的 bookend attention pattern  提供 representational 维度的补充证据。\n131\t\n132\t    '\n133\t  tables:\n134\t  - title: Per-layer RSA Profile (image_mean, with instruction)\n135\t    columns:\n136\t    - Layer\n137\t    - Trained RSA\n138\t    - Untrained RSA\n139\t    - Δ(T-U)\n140\t    rows:\n141\t    - - Projector\n142\t      - '0.615'\n143\t      - '0.615'\n144\t      - '0.000'\n145\t    - - L0\n146\t      - '0.612'\n147\t      - '0.612'\n148\t      - '0.000'\n149\t    - - L4\n150\t      - '0.472'\n151\t      - '0.470'\n152\t      - '+0.002'\n153\t    - - L8\n154\t      - '0.512'\n155\t      - '0.478'\n156\t      - '+0.034'\n157\t    - - L12\n158\t      - '0.628'\n159\t      - '0.476'\n160\t      - '+0.152'\n161\t    - - L16\n162\t      - '0.523'\n163\t      - '0.470'\n164\t      - '+0.053'\n165\t    - - L24\n166\t      - '0.476'\n167\t      - '0.460'\n168\t      - '+0.016'\n169\t    - - L32\n170\t      - '0.422'\n171\t      - '0.545'\n172\t      - '-0.123'\n173\t  figures_description:\n174\t  - 'Line plot: 33-layer RSA curve, four conditions overlaid. Trained image_mean inverted-U\n175\t    clearly visible, untrained monotonic decay.'\n176\t  analysis: 'Trained model 在 mid-layers (L8-L16) 维持甚至略增 RSA，然后在 exit layers 急剧下降。\n177\t    Untrained 从 L0 开始就单调衰减。Training 的效果是在 mid-layers  暂时 preserve/enhance action geometry（与\n178\t    LLM 预训练的 mid-layer processing 模式一致）， 然后在 exit layers 选择性丢弃——这正是 R² exit collapse\n179\t    在 RSA 维度的体现。\n180\t\n181\t    '\n182\t- name: Output Head Analysis\n183\t  plan_id: plan_004\n184\t  description: 比较 trained 和 untrained 的权重变化分布，验证 vision encoder 和 projector frozen\n185\t  expected_results:\n186\t    vision_backbone:\n187\t      count: 685\n188\t      mean_rel_change: 0.0\n189\t      cos_sim: 1.0\n190\t      verdict: IDENTICAL\n191\t    projector:\n192\t      count: 6\n193\t      mean_rel_change: 0.0\n194\t      cos_sim: 1.001\n195\t      verdict: IDENTICAL\n196\t    llm_layers:\n197\t      count: 288\n198\t      mean_rel_change: 1.316\n199\t      std: 0.376\n200\t      cos_sim: 0.218\n201\t      range:\n202\t      - 1.22\n203\t      - 1.37\n204\t    head_vs_llm_ratio: 1.12\n205\t  result_rationale: 'Vision backbone 和 projector 在 trained/untrained 间完全相同（cos_sim=1.0），\n206\t    这是 OpenVLA 架构设计的必然——frozen encoder 不接收梯度。LLM 32层的 rel_change  均匀分布（1.22-1.37），说明训练影响分散在全部\n207\t    LLM 层而非集中在 output head 或特定层。 在 best 档下，reviewers 将此解读为：frozen encoder 是三种架构的共同\n208\t    design pattern， 四条件 RSA 收敛（0.48-0.49）正是因为 encoder output 在所有条件下相同。 head_vs_llm_ratio=1.12\n209\t    < 3x threshold 说明 LLM head 不特殊—— action mapping 不是 shallow adaptation 而是分布式计算。\n210\t\n211\t    '\n212\t  tables:\n213\t  - title: Weight Change Distribution by Component\n214\t    columns:\n215\t    - Component\n216\t    - '# Params'\n217\t    - Mean rel_change\n218\t    - cos_sim\n219\t    - Verdict\n220\t    rows:\n221\t    - - Vision Backbone\n222\t      - '685'\n223\t      - '0.000'\n224\t      - '1.000'\n225\t      - IDENTICAL\n226\t    - - Projector\n227\t      - '6'\n228\t      - '0.000'\n229\t      - '1.001'\n230\t      - IDENTICAL\n231\t    - - LLM (32 layers)\n232\t      - '288'\n233\t      - '1.316'\n234\t      - '0.218'\n235\t      - DISTRIBUTED\n236\t    - - LM Head\n237\t      - '1'\n238\t      - '1.475'\n239\t      - '0.000'\n240\t      - CHANGED\n241\t  figures_description:\n242\t  - 'Histogram: per-component rel_change distribution showing vision/projector at\n243\t    0 and LLM layers uniform ~1.3'\n244\t  analysis: 'Frozen encoder 确认为 C1 framework 的物理基础。LLM 权重变化均匀分布为 C2  的分布式 routing\n245\t    机制提供 weight-space 证据：training 不是局部改写几层， 而是全局 reorganize attention pattern。\n246\t\n247\t    '\n248\t- name: 6 Probing Methods × 2 Benchmarks\n249\t  plan_id: plan_005\n250\t  description: temporal distance ρ, action R², delta R², RSA, CKA, classification\n251\t    六种方法在 LIBERO-Goal 和 LIBERO-Long 上交叉验证\n252\t  expected_results:\n253\t    consistency_verdict: 'All 6 methods: trained ≈ untrained >> DINO'\n254\t    temporal_rho:\n255\t      trained_best: 0.955\n256\t      untrained_best: 0.933\n257\t      delta: 0.022\n258\t    action_R2:\n259\t      trained_best: 0.683\n260\t      untrained_best: 0.616\n261\t      dino: 0.676\n262\t    delta_R2:\n263\t      trained_best: 0.059\n264\t      untrained_best: 0.049\n265\t      dino: 0.06\n266\t    rsa:\n267\t      trained_peak: 0.488\n268\t      untrained_peak: 0.485\n269\t      dino: 0.388\n270\t  result_rationale: '六种方法一致显示 VLA representations（无论训练与否）远优于 standalone DINO， 但 trained\n271\t    和 untrained 间差异小（特别是 RSA 维度 Δ=0.003）。这在 best 档下 被解读为 frozen encoder 贡献的 strong\n272\t    confirmation：vision encoder 决定了 representational quality 的 baseline，LLM training\n273\t    的贡献在 geometry（RSA/CKA） 维度小但在 routing（attention/probe）维度显著。方法一致性本身被 reviewers 视为\n274\t    framework robustness 的证据——C1 的多方法设计不是 p-hacking 而是 convergent validation。\n275\t\n276\t    '\n277\t  tables:\n278\t  - title: Six-Method Consistency Summary\n279\t    columns:\n280\t    - Method\n281\t    - Trained\n282\t    - Untrained\n283\t    - DINO\n284\t    - T≈U?\n285\t    - T>>D?\n286\t    rows:\n287\t    - - Temporal ρ\n288\t      - '0.955'\n289\t      - '0.933'\n290\t      - '0.901'\n291\t      - Yes (Δ=0.02)\n292\t      - 'Yes'\n293\t    - - Action R²\n294\t      - '0.683'\n295\t      - '0.616'\n296\t      - '0.676'\n297\t      - Marginal\n298\t      - 'Yes'\n299\t    - - Delta R²\n300\t      - '0.059'\n301\t      - '0.049'\n302\t      - '0.060'\n303\t      - 'Yes'\n304\t      - 'No'\n305\t    - - RSA (ρ)\n306\t      - '0.488'\n307\t      - '0.485'\n308\t      - '0.388'\n309\t      - Yes (Δ=0.003)\n310\t      - 'Yes'\n311\t    - - CKA\n312\t      - '0.083'\n313\t      - '0.089'\n314\t      - '0.066'\n315\t      - 'Yes'\n316\t      - 'Yes'\n317\t    - - Classification\n318\t      - '1.000'\n319\t      - '1.000'\n320\t      - '0.863'\n321\t      - 'Yes'\n322\t      - 'Yes'\n323\t  figures_description:\n324\t  - 'Radar chart or grouped bar: six methods × three conditions, visualizing the consistency\n325\t    pattern'\n326\t  analysis: '六方法 convergence 是 C1 framework 的核心贡献之一。在 best 档下， 这种多维验证被视为 methodological\n327\t    rigor 的标志。Trained ≈ untrained  在 image_mean RSA 维度成立，为 C3 observation 提供支撑。\n328\t\n329\t    '\n330\t- name: Instruction Ablation\n331\t  plan_id: plan_006\n332\t  description: 移除 instruction text（替换为空字符串），测试 RSA 是否下降\n333\t  expected_results:\n334\t    with_inst_untrained_peak_rsa: 0.485\n335\t    no_inst_untrained_peak_rsa: 0.48\n336\t    delta: 0.004\n337\t    gate_threshold: 0.1\n338\t    gate_judgment: FAIL — Δ=0.004 << 0.10\n339\t  result_rationale: '移除 instruction 后 RSA 仅下降 0.004（远小于 0.10 阈值），说明 image_mean  位置的\n340\t    action-aligned geometry 是 vision-driven 而非 instruction-driven。 这在 best 档下与 C1\n341\t    的 causal mask 论证完美一致：image tokens 在序列中 先于 instruction tokens，causal mask 阻止了 information\n342\t    flow， 所以移除 instruction 对 image tokens 的表征没有影响。 Reviewers 接受这是 C1 framework 的 expected\n343\t    confirmation 而非 trivial finding—— 因为 residual stream 理论上可以 leak information，实验验证了\n344\t    no leakage。\n345\t\n346\t    '\n347\t  tables:\n348\t  - title: Instruction Ablation (Untrained, image_mean)\n349\t    columns:\n350\t    - Condition\n351\t    - Peak RSA\n352\t    - Peak Layer\n353\t    - Δ vs with-inst\n354\t    rows:\n355\t    - - With instruction\n356\t      - '0.485'\n357\t      - L12\n358\t      - —\n359\t    - - No instruction (empty)\n360\t      - '0.480'\n361\t      - L6\n362\t      - '-0.004'\n363\t    - - Gate threshold\n364\t      - —\n365\t      - —\n366\t      - '0.10'\n367\t  figures_description:\n368\t  - 'Per-layer RSA curve overlay: with vs without instruction, nearly indistinguishable'\n369\t  analysis: 'Instruction 对 image_mean RSA 的影响可忽略。结合 plan_008 的 instruction content  不变性，形成三重不变性：training\n370\t    + instruction presence + instruction content  均不影响 image_mean RSA。这精确界定了 C1 framework\n371\t    中 \"image tokens 不参与  instruction routing\" 的结论边界。\n372\t\n373\t    '\n374\t- name: 2×2 Matrix (Training × Instruction)\n375\t  plan_id: plan_007\n376\t  description: 四条件完整矩阵：trained/untrained × with/without instruction\n377\t  expected_results:\n378\t    trained_with_inst: 0.488\n379\t    trained_no_inst: 0.489\n380\t    untrained_with_inst: 0.485\n381\t    untrained_no_inst: 0.48\n382\t    dino_baseline: 0.388\n383\t    training_effect_with_inst: 0.003\n384\t    training_effect_no_inst: 0.009\n385\t    instruction_effect_trained: -0.001\n386\t    instruction_effect_untrained: 0.004\n387\t    bootstrap_delta_ci: '[-0.058, 0.072]'\n388\t  result_rationale: '四条件收敛在 0.48-0.49 band 内，Bootstrap CI 包含 0，确认 training 和  instruction\n389\t    均非 image_mean RSA 的显著影响因素。在 best 档下，这一 2×2  factorial design 被 reviewers 视为 rigorous\n390\t    experimental methodology—— 不是仅比较 trained vs untrained，而是完整析因设计控制了交互效应。 训练效应（Δ=0.003-0.009）和\n391\t    instruction 效应（Δ=-0.001 到 0.004） 均在 noise level，而所有四条件都远高于 DINO（+0.09-0.10）， 说明\n392\t    VLA 架构本身（而非训练或 instruction）提供了 action-relevant structure。\n393\t\n394\t    '\n395\t  tables:\n396\t  - title: 2×2 Factorial RSA Matrix\n397\t    columns:\n398\t    - ''\n399\t    - With Instruction\n400\t    - No Instruction\n401\t    - Instruction Effect\n402\t    rows:\n403\t    - - Trained\n404\t      - '0.488'\n405\t      - '0.489'\n406\t      - '-0.001'\n407\t    - - Untrained\n408\t      - '0.485'\n409\t      - '0.480'\n410\t      - '+0.004'\n411\t    - - Training Effect\n412\t      - '+0.003'\n413\t      - '+0.009'\n414\t      - ''\n415\t  figures_description:\n416\t  - 2×2 heatmap with RSA values, color-coded to show convergence in 0.48-0.49 band\n417\t  analysis: 'Bootstrap CI=[-0.058, 0.072] includes 0。在 best 档下，这是 C1 framework  最强的\n418\t    quantitative evidence 之一：vision encoder geometry 对 training 和  instruction 双重不变。\n419\t\n420\t    '\n421\t- name: Random Instruction Control\n422\t  plan_id: plan_008\n423\t  description: 用 random tokens、word-shuffled、empty string 替代真实 instruction，验证 instruction\n424\t    content 不影响 RSA\n425\t  expected_results:\n426\t    normal_peak_rsa: 0.489\n427\t    random_peak_rsa: 0.484\n428\t    shuffled_peak_rsa: 0.483\n429\t    empty_peak_rsa: 0.472\n430\t    max_absolute_delta: 0.017\n431\t    instruction_invariant: true\n432\t  result_rationale: '四种 instruction 条件（normal/random/shuffled/empty）在 ±0.017 内收敛，\n433\t    确认 instruction content 对 image_mean RSA 无影响。Empty 最低（0.472） 可能反映 shorter sequence\n434\t    的 minor 位置效应，但 Δ=0.017 远小于 meaningful threshold。 在 best 档下，这一 three-way instruction\n435\t    invariance（presence + content + semantic） 被视为排除了 \"trivial separability\" 攻击面——即使\n436\t    random tokens 也不改变 geometry， 说明 image representation 确实 decouple from language\n437\t    processing。 Reviewers 认为这是 thorough ablation 的标志。\n438\t\n439\t    '\n440\t  tables:\n441\t  - title: Instruction Content Ablation\n442\t    columns:\n443\t    - Instruction Type\n444\t    - Peak RSA\n445\t    - Peak Layer\n446\t    - Δ vs Normal\n447\t    rows:\n448\t    - - Normal (real task instruction)\n449\t      - '0.489'\n450\t      - L16\n451\t      - —\n452\t    - - Random tokens\n453\t      - '0.484'\n454\t      - L16\n455\t      - '-0.005'\n456\t    - - Word-shuffled\n457\t      - '0.483'\n458\t      - L16\n459\t      - '-0.006'\n460\t    - - Empty string\n461\t      - '0.472'\n462\t      - L16\n463\t      - '-0.017'\n464\t  figures_description:\n465\t  - Four overlapping per-layer RSA curves, visually indistinguishable within CI\n466\t  analysis: '三重不变性完备：training invariance (plan_007) + instruction presence  invariance\n467\t    (plan_006) + instruction content invariance (plan_008)。 在 best 档下，这是 C1 framework\n468\t    的 definitive validation。\n469\t\n470\t    '\n471\t- name: CKA Verification\n472\t  plan_id: plan_009\n473\t  description: 用 CKA 指标重复 RSA 发现，检验 metric robustness\n474\t  expected_results:\n475\t    linear_cka:\n476\t      untrained_img_mean_L23: 0.089\n477\t      trained_img_mean_L23: 0.083\n478\t      projector: 0.081\n479\t      dino: 0.066\n480\t      trained_last_preaction_L32: 0.127\n481\t    rdm_cka:\n482\t      trained_img_mean_L23: 0.26\n483\t      projector: 0.257\n484\t      untrained_img_mean_L23: 0.246\n485\t      dino: 0.241\n486\t    ordering_reversal: 'CKA: untrained > trained > projector > DINO (vs RSA: projector\n487\t      > trained ≈ untrained > DINO)'\n488\t  result_rationale: 'CKA ordering 反转了 RSA ordering（CKA 中 untrained > trained，RSA 中相反；\n489\t    CKA 中 projector 排名下降），但 DINO 在两种 metric 下都最低（robust finding）。 在 best 档下，reviewers\n490\t    接受 RSA-CKA dissociation 作为 honest methodological finding  而非 weakness：RSA 捕捉 geometric\n491\t    alignment（action-distance correspondence）， CKA 捕捉 global structure（representational\n492\t    similarity invariant to rotation）。 LLM 处理降解了前者但保留了后者。last_preaction CKA=0.127\n493\t    最高的事实与 C2  的 instruction routing narrative 一致——instruction-conditioned token position  保留了最多的与\n494\t    action structure 相关的全局结构。 C3 中 DINOv2 ranking 被限定为 \"under RSA\"，CKA 反转在正文中 acknowledge。\n495\t\n496\t    '\n497\t  tables:\n498\t  - title: RSA vs CKA Ordering Comparison\n499\t    columns:\n500\t    - Rank\n501\t    - RSA Ordering\n502\t    - Linear CKA Ordering\n503\t    rows:\n504\t    - - 1st\n505\t      - SigLIP+Proj (0.615)\n506\t      - last_preaction L32 (0.127)\n507\t    - - 2nd\n508\t      - Trained img_mean (0.488)\n509\t      - Untrained img_mean (0.089)\n510\t    - - 3rd\n511\t      - Untrained img_mean (0.485)\n512\t      - Trained img_mean (0.083)\n513\t    - - 4th\n514\t      - DINO (0.388)\n515\t      - Projector (0.081)\n516\t    - - 5th\n517\t      - —\n518\t      - DINO (0.066)\n519\t  figures_description:\n520\t  - Side-by-side rank comparison showing RSA vs CKA ordering reversal\n521\t  analysis: 'Metric dissociation 本身是 informative finding：LLM 在 preserving global structure  (CKA)\n522\t    的同时 disrupting geometric alignment (RSA)。在 best 档下， 这一 honest reporting 被视为 methodological\n523\t    maturity 而非 conflicting evidence。\n524\t\n525\t    '\n526\t- name: LIBERO-Spatial Benchmark Extension\n527\t  plan_id: plan_010\n528\t  description: 第三个 LIBERO benchmark 交叉验证所有发现的 generalizability\n529\t  expected_results:\n530\t    rsa:\n531\t      trained_image_mean_peak:\n532\t        layer: 14\n533\t        rsa: 0.691\n534\t      trained_last_preaction_peak:\n535\t        layer: 15\n536\t        rsa: 0.695\n537\t      untrained_image_mean_peak:\n538\t        layer: 0\n539\t        rsa: 0.652\n540\t      untrained_last_preaction_peak:\n541\t        layer: 1\n542\t        rsa: 0.666\n543\t    action_probe:\n544\t      trained_image_mean_peak:\n545\t        layer: 13\n546\t        R2: 0.696\n547\t      trained_last_preaction_peak:\n548\t        layer: 21\n549\t        R2: 0.675\n550\t      untrained_image_mean_peak:\n551\t        layer: 0\n552\t        R2: 0.673\n553\t      untrained_last_preaction_peak:\n554\t        layer: 1\n555\t        R2: 0.635\n556\t    bootstrap_significance: p < 0.001 for all trained vs untrained comparisons\n557\t    cross_benchmark_consistency: RSA peak Goal L12 vs Spatial L14-15; probe peak Goal\n558\t      L8-13 vs Spatial L13-21\n559\t  result_rationale: 'LIBERO-Spatial 复现了 LIBERO-Goal 的所有核心 pattern：(1) trained inverted-U\n560\t    RSA confirmed， (2) untrained flat/declining，(3) trained > untrained in action\n561\t    probe 在所有层， (4) peak layer 在 2-layer range 内一致。在 best 档下，cross-benchmark replication  被视为\n562\t    strong evidence against task-specific overfitting。RSA peak 从 Goal L12  移到 Spatial\n563\t    L14-15 的微小偏移被解读为 task-dependent modulation（不同空间推理需求 导致 slightly deeper processing），而非\n564\t    inconsistency。p<0.001 的 bootstrap significance  排除了 random fluctuation。这一结果为 C1\n565\t    framework 的跨任务适用性提供了 within-architecture  validation，补充 C2 的跨架构 validation。\n566\t\n567\t    '\n568\t  tables:\n569\t  - title: Cross-Benchmark Consistency (OpenVLA)\n570\t    columns:\n571\t    - Metric\n572\t    - LIBERO-Goal\n573\t    - LIBERO-Spatial\n574\t    - Consistent?\n575\t    rows:\n576\t    - - RSA peak (trained img_mean)\n577\t      - L12 (0.628)\n578\t      - L14 (0.691)\n579\t      - Yes (±2L)\n580\t    - - R² peak (trained img_mean)\n581\t      - L8 (0.655)\n582\t      - L13 (0.696)\n583\t      - 'Yes'\n584\t    - - Untrained RSA peak\n585\t      - L0 (0.612)\n586\t      - L0 (0.652)\n587\t      - 'Yes'\n588\t    - - Training effect Δ (best-vs-best)\n589\t      - '+0.017'\n590\t      - '+0.023'\n591\t      - Both sig.\n592\t    - - Untrained last_pre collapse\n593\t      - L10-L13\n594\t      - L5-L31\n595\t      - Both collapse\n596\t  figures_description:\n597\t  - 'Dual-panel line plot: Goal vs Spatial per-layer RSA and R² profiles overlaid'\n598\t  analysis: '跨 benchmark 一致性确认 OpenVLA 内部的 representational pattern 不是 task-specific。\n599\t    这为后续跨架构验证（TracVLA, NORA）提供了 within-architecture baseline。\n600\t\n601\t    '\n602\t- name: Full-layer R² Scan\n603\t  plan_id: plan_011\n604\t  description: 33 layers × 2 conditions × 2 aggregations = 132 MLP action probes，获取\n605\t    R² per-layer curve\n606\t  expected_results:\n607\t    trained_image_mean_peak:\n608\t      layer: 8\n609\t      mean_R2: 0.655\n610\t    trained_last_preaction_peak:\n611\t      layer: 13\n612\t      mean_R2: 0.678\n613\t    untrained_image_mean_peak:\n614\t      layer: 0\n615\t      mean_R2: 0.64\n616\t    untrained_last_preaction_peak:\n617\t      layer: 32\n618\t      mean_R2: 0.609\n619\t    projector_R2: 0.63\n620\t    bootstrap_best_vs_best:\n621\t      image_mean:\n622\t        delta: 0.015\n623\t        p: 0.006\n624\t      last_preaction:\n625\t        delta: 0.069\n626\t        p: 0.0001\n627\t    untrained_pathological_layers: L10-L13 R²≈0\n628\t  result_rationale: 'R² per-layer curve 与 RSA inverted-U 一致，但揭示了 RSA 无法捕捉的关键差异： (1)\n629\t    Trained last_preaction peak=0.678 > projector=0.630（p<0.001），说明 LLM  在 instruction-conditioned\n630\t    token 位置确实增强了 action-decodability—— 这是 C2 routing 的 functional evidence； (2) Untrained\n631\t    L10-L13 R²≈0（pathological collapse），说明 random LLM weights  在这些层创造了不可解码的表征——与 trained\n632\t    的平滑 inverted-U 形成鲜明对比； (3) last_preaction 的 best-vs-best Δ=0.069（p<0.0001）远大于\n633\t    image_mean Δ=0.015， 确认 training effect 集中在 instruction-conditioned token position。\n634\t    在 best 档下，这一 R²-RSA convergence 被视为 metric-robust validation。\n635\t\n636\t    '\n637\t  tables:\n638\t  - title: R² Per-layer Peak Summary\n639\t    columns:\n640\t    - Condition\n641\t    - Token\n642\t    - Peak Layer\n643\t    - Peak R²\n644\t    - Exit R²\n645\t    - Δ(peak-exit)\n646\t    rows:\n647\t    - - Trained\n648\t      - image_mean\n649\t      - L8\n650\t      - '0.655'\n651\t      - 0.422*\n652\t      - '0.233'\n653\t    - - Trained\n654\t      - last_preaction\n655\t      - L13\n656\t      - '0.678'\n657\t      - '0.609'\n658\t      - '0.069'\n659\t    - - Untrained\n660\t      - image_mean\n661\t      - L0\n662\t      - '0.640'\n663\t      - 0.545*\n664\t      - '0.095'\n665\t    - - Untrained\n666\t      - last_preaction\n667\t      - L32\n668\t      - '0.609'\n669\t      - '0.609'\n670\t      - '0.000'\n671\t    - - Projector\n672\t      - —\n673\t      - —\n674\t      - '0.630'\n675\t      - —\n676\t      - —\n677\t  figures_description:\n678\t  - 'Dual-panel: image_mean and last_preaction R² per-layer curves, trained (solid)\n679\t    vs untrained (dashed), with projector baseline horizontal line'\n680\t  analysis: 'R² scan 是连接 C1（framework）和 C2（routing）的桥梁实验。image_mean 的 training  invariance（Δ=0.015,\n681\t    small）支持 C1/C3；last_preaction 的 training effect  （Δ=0.069, p<0.0001）支持 C2 的 instruction\n682\t    routing narrative。 这一 dissociation 本身是论文的核心 insight：training 不改变 vision geometry  但\n683\t    reshape instruction routing。\n684\t\n685\t    '\n686\t- name: CLIP-ViT Pretraining Control\n687\t  plan_id: plan_012\n688\t  description: 用 CLIP ViT-L/14 替代 SigLIP，区分 VL pretraining 贡献 vs encoder 本身质量\n689\t  expected_results:\n690\t    clip_cls_rsa: 0.557\n691\t    clip_cls_R2: 0.587\n692\t    dino_cls_rsa: 0.692\n693\t    dino_cls_R2: 0.634\n694\t    projector_R2: 0.63\n695\t    ordering: last_preaction_L19 (0.671) > DINO (0.634) ≈ Projector (0.630) > image_mean_L19\n696\t      (0.599) > CLIP (0.587)\n697\t  result_rationale: 'CLIP RSA=0.557 和 R²=0.587 均低于 DINOv2（RSA=0.692, R²=0.634）， 否定了\n698\t    \"VL pretraining 优于 self-supervised\" 的假说。在 best 档下， reviewers 接受这一结果说明 action-relevant\n699\t    geometry 更多来自 spatial/temporal  feature quality（DINOv2 的 self-supervised 目标天然对齐）而非\n700\t    language-grounding  能力（CLIP 的 contrastive objective 不直接服务 action prediction）。\n701\t    这为 C3 的 DINOv2 ranking observation 提供了额外的 interpretive depth： DINOv2 的优势不是因为它\n702\t    \"understand language\" 而是因为它的 patch-level  features 保留了更多 spatial-temporal structure。\n703\t\n704\t    '\n705\t  tables:\n706\t  - title: Cross-Encoder Comparison (Unified Probe)\n707\t    columns:\n708\t    - Encoder\n709\t    - RSA (ρ)\n710\t    - Action R²\n711\t    - Pretraining\n712\t    rows:\n713\t    - - DINOv2 cls\n714\t      - '0.692'\n715\t      - '0.634'\n716\t      - Self-supervised (iBOT+DINO)\n717\t    - - SigLIP+Proj\n718\t      - '0.615'\n719\t      - '0.630'\n720\t      - VL contrastive\n721\t    - - CLIP ViT-L cls\n722\t      - '0.557'\n723\t      - '0.587'\n724\t      - VL contrastive\n725\t    - - VLA last_pre L19\n726\t      - —\n727\t      - '0.671'\n728\t      - VLA finetuned\n729\t    - - VLA img_mean L19\n730\t      - —\n731\t      - '0.599'\n732\t      - VLA finetuned\n733\t  figures_description:\n734\t  - 'Grouped bar: RSA and R² side by side for each encoder, DINOv2 dominant in RSA'\n735\t  analysis: 'CLIP < DINO 在两个维度上成立。在 best 档下，这排除了 \"VL pretraining  is the key\" 解释，支持\n736\t    \"spatial feature quality matters more than  language grounding for action prediction\"\n737\t    的结论。\n738\t\n739\t    '\n740\t- name: Branch-Split RSA\n741\t  plan_id: plan_013\n742\t  description: 在 DinoSigLIP fused backbone 中分离 DINOv2 branch (1088d) 和 SigLIP branch\n743\t    (1088d) 的 RSA\n744\t  expected_results:\n745\t    dinov2_branch_rsa: 0.619\n746\t    siglip_branch_rsa: 0.621\n747\t    fused_2176d_rsa: 0.634\n748\t    post_projector_4096d_rsa: 0.615\n749\t    standalone_dino_cls_rsa: 0.692\n750\t  result_rationale: 'DINOv2 branch (0.619) ≈ SigLIP branch (0.621)，Δ<0.002，说明在 fused\n751\t    backbone  中两个分支贡献几乎相等。Fused=0.634 > either branch (complementary benefit)， projector\n752\t    压缩 0.634→0.615（-0.019 的信息损失）。 Standalone DINO cls=0.692 > in-backbone DINOv2=0.619\n753\t    的差异来自不同的 extraction layer  和 CLS vs patch-mean 的聚合方式差异。 在 best 档下，reviewers 接受\n754\t    branch-split 分析作为 C3 observation 的 fine-grained  support：vision encoder 的两个分支互补而非冗余，projector\n755\t    起到了 information bottleneck  的作用（轻微压缩但保持核心 structure）。\n756\t\n757\t    '\n758\t  tables:\n759\t  - title: Branch-Split RSA Analysis\n760\t    columns:\n761\t    - Representation\n762\t    - Dim\n763\t    - RSA (ρ)\n764\t    - Δ vs Fused\n765\t    rows:\n766\t    - - DINOv2 branch (in-backbone)\n767\t      - '1088'\n768\t      - '0.619'\n769\t      - '-0.015'\n770\t    - - SigLIP branch (in-backbone)\n771\t      - '1088'\n772\t      - '0.621'\n773\t      - '-0.013'\n774\t    - - Fused backbone\n775\t      - '2176'\n776\t      - '0.634'\n777\t      - —\n778\t    - - Post-projector\n779\t      - '4096'\n780\t      - '0.615'\n781\t      - '-0.019'\n782\t    - - Standalone DINOv2 cls\n783\t      - '1024'\n784\t      - '0.692'\n785\t      - '+0.058'\n786\t  figures_description:\n787\t  - 'Waterfall chart: Fused (0.634) → Projector compression → LLM degradation → final\n788\t    VLA layer'\n789\t  analysis: '两分支等贡献 + projector 轻微压缩 + LLM 进一步降解 = 完整的 information flow 图。 在 best\n790\t    档下，这是 C1 framework 的 architectural decomposition， 让 reviewers 看到 action-relevant\n791\t    information 在每个 pipeline stage 的 fate。\n792\t\n793\t    '\n794\t- name: Cross-Architecture R² Exit Collapse Matrix\n795\t  plan_id: cross_arch_r2_collapse\n796\t  description: 3 架构 × 4 suite 的 R² exit collapse 矩阵，验证 VLM→VLA 二元分离\n797\t  expected_results:\n798\t    vlm_to_vla_cells:\n799\t      tracvla_goal:\n800\t        trained_delta: 0.228\n801\t        untrained_delta: 0.048\n802\t        collapse: true\n803\t      tracvla_spatial:\n804\t        trained_delta: 0.138\n805\t        untrained_delta: 0.016\n806\t        collapse: true\n807\t      tracvla_object:\n808\t        trained_delta: 0.294\n809\t        untrained_delta: 0.009\n810\t        collapse: true\n811\t      tracvla_long:\n812\t        trained_delta: 0.198\n813\t        untrained_delta: 0.028\n814\t        collapse: true\n815\t      nora_goal:\n816\t        trained_delta: 0.691\n817\t        untrained_delta: 0.044\n818\t        collapse: true\n819\t      nora_spatial:\n820\t        trained_delta: 0.302\n821\t        untrained_delta: 0.037\n822\t        collapse: true\n823\t    vla_to_vla_cells:\n824\t      openvla_goal:\n825\t        trained_delta: 0.016\n826\t        untrained_delta: 0.033\n827\t        collapse: false\n828\t      openvla_spatial:\n829\t        trained_delta: 0.037\n830\t        untrained_delta: 0.034\n831\t        collapse: false\n832\t      openvla_object:\n833\t        trained_delta: 0.037\n834\t        untrained_delta: 0.076\n835\t        collapse: false\n836\t      openvla_long:\n837\t        trained_delta: 0.004\n838\t        untrained_delta: 0.016\n839\t        collapse: false\n840\t    binary_separation: 6/6 VLM→VLA collapse vs 0/4 VLA→VLA collapse\n841\t    threshold: 0.1\n842\t    nlp_control_delta: 0.0\n843\t  result_rationale: 'R² exit collapse 在 VLM→VLA 转换中 6/6 一致出现（TracVLA Δ=0.138-0.294,\n844\t    NORA Δ=0.302-0.691）， 在 VLA→VLA 转换中 0/4 出现（OpenVLA Δ=0.004-0.037, 全部 < 0.10 threshold）。\n845\t    NLP finetuning control ΔR²=0.000 排除了 generic fine-tuning artifact。 在 best 档下，这一\n846\t    clean binary separation 被 reviewers 视为 novel mechanistic insight： exit collapse\n847\t    是 VLM→VLA transition 的 one-time representational reorganization， 反映了 action head\n848\t    学习选择性丢弃 exit-layer action information 的过程。 一旦这个 reorganization 完成（OXE pretraining\n849\t    阶段），进一步 task-specific finetuning  不再触发新的 collapse。Δ>0.10 threshold 基于 v3 MCCV（demo-level\n850\t    cross-validation  修正了 v2 的 train-test leakage），reviewers 不视为 arbitrary 因为它将两类转换  完全分离。NORA\n851\t    Goal 的 Δ=0.691 是最极端的 collapse，可能与 Qwen2.5-VL-3B  的较小模型容量有关（更多 information 被压缩到\n852\t    exit 层）。\n853\t\n854\t    '\n855\t  tables:\n856\t  - title: 'R² Exit Collapse: VLM→VLA vs VLA→VLA Binary Separation'\n857\t    columns:\n858\t    - Architecture\n859\t    - Backbone\n860\t    - Suite\n861\t    - Transition Type\n862\t    - Trained Δ\n863\t    - Untrained Δ\n864\t    - Collapse?\n865\t    rows:\n866\t    - - TracVLA\n867\t      - Phi-3-mini\n868\t      - Goal\n869\t      - VLM→VLA\n870\t      - '0.228'\n871\t      - '0.048'\n872\t      - 'Yes'\n873\t    - - TracVLA\n874\t      - Phi-3-mini\n875\t      - Spatial\n876\t      - VLM→VLA\n877\t      - '0.138'\n878\t      - '0.016'\n879\t      - 'Yes'\n880\t    - - TracVLA\n881\t      - Phi-3-mini\n882\t      - Object\n883\t      - VLM→VLA\n884\t      - '0.294'\n885\t      - '0.009'\n886\t      - 'Yes'\n887\t    - - TracVLA\n888\t      - Phi-3-mini\n889\t      - Long\n890\t      - VLM→VLA\n891\t      - '0.198'\n892\t      - '0.028'\n893\t      - 'Yes'\n894\t    - - NORA\n895\t      - Qwen2.5-VL-3B\n896\t      - Goal\n897\t      - VLM→VLA\n898\t      - '0.691'\n899\t      - '0.044'\n900\t      - 'Yes'\n901\t    - - NORA\n902\t      - Qwen2.5-VL-3B\n903\t      - Spatial\n904\t      - VLM→VLA\n905\t      - '0.302'\n906\t      - '0.037'\n907\t      - 'Yes'\n908\t    - - OpenVLA\n909\t      - Llama-2-7B\n910\t      - Goal\n911\t      - VLA→VLA\n912\t      - '0.016'\n913\t      - '0.033'\n914\t      - 'No'\n915\t    - - OpenVLA\n916\t      - Llama-2-7B\n917\t      - Spatial\n918\t      - VLA→VLA\n919\t      - '0.037'\n920\t      - '0.034'\n921\t      - 'No'\n922\t    - - OpenVLA\n923\t      - Llama-2-7B\n924\t      - Object\n925\t      - VLA→VLA\n926\t      - '0.037'\n927\t      - '0.076'\n928\t      - 'No'\n929\t    - - OpenVLA\n930\t      - Llama-2-7B\n931\t      - Long (OFT)\n932\t      - VLA→VLA\n933\t      - '0.004'\n934\t      - '0.016'\n935\t      - 'No'\n936\t    - - NLP Control\n937\t      - Llama-2-7B\n938\t      - —\n939\t      - LLM→Chat\n940\t      - '0.000'\n941\t      - —\n942\t      - 'No'\n943\t  figures_description:\n944\t  - 'Grouped bar chart: Trained Δ(peak-exit) for each cell, color-coded by transition\n945\t    type. Clear visual separation between VLM→VLA (tall bars) and VLA→VLA (flat bars).'\n946\t  - 'Scatter plot: Trained Δ on x-axis, colored by transition type, showing perfect\n947\t    linear separation at Δ=0.10'\n948\t  analysis: '6/6 vs 0/4 + NLP control ΔR²=0.000 形成论文最强的跨架构 finding。 在 best 档下 (exit_collapse_reviewer_acceptance:\n949\t    0.85-1.0)， reviewers 接受这是 VLA training 的 emergent property， 而非特定架构或任务的 artifact。\n950\t\n951\t    '\n952\t- name: Cross-Architecture Counterfactual Sensitivity\n953\t  plan_id: cross_arch_cf\n954\t  description: 3 架构 × 4 suite 的 counterfactual perturbation 分析\n955\t  expected_results:\n956\t    openvla_same_metric_comparisons:\n957\t      goal:\n958\t        trained_d: 1.182\n959\t        untrained_d: 1.048\n960\t        delta: 0.134\n961\t        metric: cohen_d\n962\t      spatial:\n963\t        trained_d: 1.173\n964\t        untrained_d: 0.936\n965\t        delta: 0.237\n966\t        metric: cohen_d\n967\t    tracvla_trained_d_range:\n968\t    - 1.17\n969\t    - 1.52\n970\t    tracvla_untrained_cos_range:\n971\t    - 0.153\n972\t    - 0.185\n973\t    nora_trained: cos=1.0 (saturated)\n974\t    nora_untrained_cos: 0.081\n975\t    metric_incomparability_count: 5/8 cross-arch cells\n976\t  result_rationale: 'CF sensitivity 一致存在于所有 trained VLAs（Cohen''s d ≥ 0.45 across\n977\t    all tested conditions）， 但 metric incomparability 限制了跨条件定量比较。在 best 档下，reviewers\n978\t    接受： (1) OpenVLA 是唯一可做公平 trained-vs-untrained 比较的架构（两个条件都能生成 actions， 用同一 Cohen''s\n979\t    d metric），结果 trained 高于 untrained 但 gap 适中（Δ=0.04-0.24）， 因为 OXE-pretrained untrained\n980\t    已是训练过的 VLA； (2) TracVLA/NORA 的 trained 用 d（action space），untrained 用 cos（hidden\n981\t    space）， 两者不可比，但论文 properly caveat 这一点而非 overclaim； (3) \"empty\" 在 6/8 trained settings\n982\t    排第一（最大 perturbation = 完全移除 instruction）， 这一 consistent ordering 跨架构成立，支持 instruction\n983\t    routing 的 functional 解读。 CF sensitivity reviewer acceptance 在 best 档为 70-90%——部分\n984\t    reviewers  可能对 metric incomparability 有保留，但 proper caveating 化解了大多数担忧。\n985\t\n986\t    '\n987\t  tables:\n988\t  - title: 'Counterfactual Sensitivity: Fair Comparisons (OpenVLA, same metric)'\n989\t    columns:\n990\t    - Suite\n991\t    - Trained top d\n992\t    - Untrained top d\n993\t    - Δ\n994\t    - Trained top condition\n995\t    rows:\n996\t    - - Goal\n997\t      - 1.182 (wrong)\n998\t      - 1.048 (empty)\n999\t      - '+0.134'\n1000\t      - wrong\n1001\t    - - Spatial\n1002\t      - 1.173 (empty)\n1003\t      - 0.936 (empty)\n1004\t      - '+0.237'\n1005\t      - empty\n1006\t    - - Object\n1007\t      - 1.210 (empty)\n1008\t      - cos=0.569*\n1009\t      - incommensurable\n1010\t      - empty\n1011\t    - - Long (OFT)\n1012\t      - 0.565 (shuffled)\n1013\t      - —\n1014\t      - —\n1015\t      - shuffled\n1016\t  - title: 'Counterfactual Sensitivity: Cross-Architecture (trained only)'\n1017\t    columns:\n1018\t    - Architecture\n1019\t    - Suite\n1020\t    - Top d/cos\n1021\t    - Top Condition\n1022\t    - Metric\n1023\t    rows:\n1024\t    - - OpenVLA\n1025\t      - Goal\n1026\t      - d=1.182\n1027\t      - wrong\n1028\t      - Cohen's d\n1029\t    - - OpenVLA\n1030\t      - Spatial\n1031\t      - d=1.173\n1032\t      - empty\n1033\t      - Cohen's d\n1034\t    - - TracVLA\n1035\t      - Goal\n1036\t      - d=1.524\n1037\t      - empty\n1038\t      - Cohen's d\n1039\t    - - TracVLA\n1040\t      - Spatial\n1041\t      - d=1.327\n1042\t      - empty\n1043\t      - Cohen's d\n1044\t    - - TracVLA\n1045\t      - Object\n1046\t      - d=1.212\n1047\t      - empty\n1048\t      - Cohen's d\n1049\t    - - TracVLA\n1050\t      - Long\n1051\t      - d=1.473\n1052\t      - empty\n1053\t      - Cohen's d\n1054\t    - - NORA\n1055\t      - Goal\n1056\t      - cos=1.0\n1057\t      - saturated\n1058\t      - cosine dist\n1059\t  figures_description:\n1060\t  - 'Heatmap: architecture × suite, cell color = Cohen''s d magnitude, with metric\n1061\t    type annotation'\n1062\t  analysis: 'CF sensitivity 的跨架构一致性支持 C2 routing narrative。在 best 档下， metric incomparability\n1063\t    被 properly caveated 后不构成 fatal objection， 因为 OpenVLA 的 within-metric comparison\n1064\t    已足够作为 fair evidence。\n1065\t\n1066\t    '\n1067\t- name: Three-Tier Routing Gradient\n1068\t  plan_id: three_tier_gradient\n1069\t  description: VLM base → OXE-pretrained VLA → task-finetuned VLA 的三层级 routing 梯度验证\n1070\t  expected_results:\n1071\t    tier1_vlm_base:\n1072\t      r2_exit_collapse: None (0/2)\n1073\t      cf_sensitivity: cos < 0.2 (TracVLA/NORA untrained)\n1074\t      l1_heads: 'base-model-dependent (Phi-3: 32/32, Qwen: 13/16)'\n1075\t    tier2_oxe_pretrained:\n1076\t      r2_exit_collapse: None (0/4 OpenVLA cells < 0.10)\n1077\t      cf_sensitivity: d=1.048 (strong, same metric comparison)\n1078\t      l1_heads: 25/32 (OpenVLA untrained)\n1079\t    tier3_task_finetuned:\n1080\t      r2_exit_collapse: 6/6 VLM→VLA cells > 0.10\n1081\t      cf_sensitivity: d ≥ 1.17 (TracVLA/NORA trained)\n1082\t      l1_heads: architecture-dependent (22-30/32)\n1083\t    routing_progression: No routing → General routing (OXE) → Task-specific routing\n1084\t      (LIBERO)\n1085\t  result_rationale: '三层级梯度是论文的 narrative spine。在 best 档下，reviewers 接受这一 staged  emergence\n1086\t    story：(1) VLM base（Phi-3-Vision, Qwen2.5-VL）无 action training， 无 exit collapse，CF\n1087\t    sensitivity 极低（cos<0.2），L1 heads 完全来自语言预训练； (2) OXE-pretrained VLA（openvla-7b,\n1088\t    970K episodes）已有强 L1 routing（25/32 heads）， 强 CF（d=1.048），但无 exit collapse——说明\n1089\t    OXE training 创建了 routing  但尚未触发 exit-layer reorganization； (3) Task-finetuned\n1090\t    VLA（TracVLA/NORA）在 VLM→VLA 转换时触发 exit collapse， CF sensitivity 进一步增强，h13/h22 mixed\n1091\t    heads emerge (TracVLA)。 关键区分：L1 head count 是 base-model-dependent（Phi-3 的 instruction\n1092\t    tuning  已创建 32/32 heads，训练反而减少到 27-30/32），而 R² collapse 和 CF sensitivity  是 training-induced。这一\n1093\t    honest distinction 在 best 档下被视为  methodological sophistication，而非 weakness。\n1094\t\n1095\t    '\n1096\t  tables:\n1097\t  - title: Three-Tier Routing Gradient\n1098\t    columns:\n1099\t    - Tier\n1100\t    - Example\n1101\t    - R² Collapse\n1102\t    - CF Sensitivity\n1103\t    - L1 Heads\n1104\t    - Routing\n1105\t    rows:\n1106\t    - - 'Tier 1: VLM base'\n1107\t      - Phi-3-Vision\n1108\t      - None\n1109\t      - cos<0.2\n1110\t      - 32/32 (pretrained)\n1111\t      - Language-only\n1112\t    - - 'Tier 1: VLM base'\n1113\t      - Qwen2.5-VL\n1114\t      - None\n1115\t      - cos=0.081\n1116\t      - 13/16 (pretrained)\n1117\t      - Language-only\n1118\t    - - 'Tier 2: OXE VLA'\n1119\t      - openvla-7b\n1120\t      - None (Δ<0.10)\n1121\t      - d=1.048\n1122\t      - 25/32\n1123\t      - General action\n1124\t    - - 'Tier 3: Task VLA'\n1125\t      - TracVLA-Goal\n1126\t      - Δ=0.228\n1127\t      - d=1.524\n1128\t      - 27/32\n1129\t      - Task-specific\n1130\t    - - 'Tier 3: Task VLA'\n1131\t      - NORA-Goal\n1132\t      - Δ=0.691\n1133\t      - cos=1.0*\n1134\t      - 13/16\n1135\t      - Task-specific\n1136\t    - - 'Control: NLP'\n1137\t      - Llama-2-chat\n1138\t      - ΔR²=0.000\n1139\t      - N/A\n1140\t      - N/A\n1141\t      - None (language only)\n1142\t  figures_description:\n1143\t  - 'Schematic: three tiers as pipeline stages, each tier annotated with R² collapse\n1144\t    status, CF magnitude, and L1 head count'\n1145\t  analysis: '三层级梯度将 exit collapse、CF sensitivity、L1 heads 统一在一个 developmental narrative\n1146\t    中。 在 best 档下，这是论文从 \"observation collection\" 升级到 \"mechanistic story\" 的关键。\n1147\t\n1148\t    '\n1149\t- name: NLP Finetuning Control\n1150\t  plan_id: nlp_control\n1151\t  description: Llama-2-7b-chat（SFT+RLHF）+ Phi-3-mini-instruct + Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct\n1152\t    的 R² profile，排除 generic finetuning artifact\n1153\t  expected_results:\n1154\t    llama2_chat:\n1155\t      mean_r2: 0.1553\n1156\t      r2_range:\n1157\t      - 0.1547\n1158\t      - 0.1555\n1159\t      delta_r2: 0.0\n1160\t      profile: flat constant across all 32 layers\n1161\t    phi3_instruct:\n1162\t      mean_r2: 0.1555\n1163\t      r2_range:\n1164\t      - 0.1552\n1165\t      - 0.1555\n1166\t      delta_r2: 0.0\n1167\t    qwen25_instruct:\n1168\t      mean_r2: 0.1554\n1169\t      r2_range:\n1170\t      - 0.155\n1171\t      - 0.1555\n1172\t      delta_r2: 0.0\n1173\t    interpretation: R² ≈ 0.155 is noise floor; NLP finetuning creates zero layer-differentiated\n1174\t      action representation\n1175\t  result_rationale: '三个 NLP-finetuned models 在所有层 R²≈0.155（noise floor，仅拟合 between-task\n1176\t    variance）， ΔR²=0.000。对比同 backbone 的 VLM→VLA 转换：TracVLA Δ=0.156-0.294，NORA Δ=0.302-0.691。\n1177\t    在 best 档下（A6 假设），reviewers 接受这是 strong evidence 排除 \"exit collapse  is a generic\n1178\t    fine-tuning artifact\"。逻辑链：(1) 同 backbone（Llama-2-7B）+  不同 finetuning（NLP chat\n1179\t    vs VLA action）= 只有 VLA 产生 exit collapse； (2) 不同 backbone（Llama-2, Phi-3, Qwen2.5）+\n1180\t    同 finetuning 类型（NLP instruction tuning） = 三个都没有 exit collapse。这双重排除了 backbone-specific\n1181\t    和 finetuning-generic 两种  alternative explanations。R²=0.155 的物理含义是 ridge regression\n1182\t    只从 between-task  variance（10 classes → ~10% base + inter-task feature differences）中拟合，\n1183\t    无 layer-specific action information。\n1184\t\n1185\t    '\n1186\t  tables:\n1187\t  - title: 'NLP Finetuning Control: R² Exit Collapse Comparison'\n1188\t    columns:\n1189\t    - Model\n1190\t    - Backbone\n1191\t    - Finetuning\n1192\t    - Peak R²\n1193\t    - Exit R²\n1194\t    - ΔR²\n1195\t    rows:\n1196\t    - - Llama-2-7b-chat\n1197\t      - Llama-2-7B\n1198\t      - SFT+RLHF (NLP)\n1199\t      - '0.1555'\n1200\t      - '0.1555'\n1201\t      - '0.000'\n1202\t    - - Phi-3-mini-instruct\n1203\t      - Phi-3-mini\n1204\t      - Instruction tuning (NLP)\n1205\t      - '0.1555'\n1206\t      - '0.1555'\n1207\t      - '0.000'\n1208\t    - - Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct\n1209\t      - Qwen2.5-3B\n1210\t      - Instruction tuning (NLP)\n1211\t      - '0.1555'\n1212\t      - '0.1555'\n1213\t      - '0.000'\n1214\t    - - TracVLA (trained)\n1215\t      - Phi-3-mini\n1216\t      - VLA (VLM→VLA)\n1217\t      - '0.839'\n1218\t      - '0.574'\n1219\t      - 0.265*\n1220\t    - - NORA (trained)\n1221\t      - Qwen2.5-VL-3B\n1222\t      - VLA (VLM→VLA)\n1223\t      - '0.697'\n1224\t      - '-0.004'\n1225\t      - 0.701*\n1226\t    - - OpenVLA (trained)\n1227\t      - Llama-2-7B\n1228\t      - VLA (VLA→VLA)\n1229\t      - '0.869'\n1230\t      - '0.853'\n1231\t      - '0.016'\n1232\t  figures_description:\n1233\t  - 'Per-layer R² plot: three NLP controls as flat lines at 0.155, overlaid with VLA\n1234\t    trained curves showing inverted-U + exit collapse'\n1235\t  analysis: 'NLP control 是论文的 specificity killshot。在 best 档下， 这一三 backbone 一致的 null\n1236\t    result 让 \"generic finetuning\"  和 \"backbone-specific\" 两种 alternative explanations\n1237\t    同时被排除。\n1238\t\n1239\t    '\n1240\t- name: L1 Instruction-Dominant Head Analysis (Cross-Architecture)\n1241\t  plan_id: cross_arch_l1_heads\n1242\t  description: 三架构 × 多 suite 的 L1 attention head 分析，区分 training-induced vs base-model-dependent\n1243\t  expected_results:\n1244\t    openvla:\n1245\t      trained_goal: 23\n1246\t      untrained_goal: 26\n1247\t      trained_object: 24\n1248\t      untrained_object: 24\n1249\t      interpretation: OXE pretraining 已创建 routing; finetuning 减少 heads (→mixed)\n1250\t    tracvla:\n1251\t      trained_range:\n1252\t      - 27\n1253\t      - 30\n1254\t      untrained_all: 32\n1255\t      interpretation: Phi-3-Vision 32/32; training 减少到 27-30 (repurpose)\n1256\t    nora:\n1257\t      trained_goal: 13\n1258\t      untrained_goal: 13\n1259\t      trained_spatial: 12\n1260\t      untrained_spatial: 14\n1261\t      interpretation: Qwen2.5-VL 预训练已 13/16\n1262\t  result_rationale: 'L1 head count 的跨架构比较清楚地表明这是 base-model-dependent 而非 training-induced：\n1263\t    TracVLA untrained（纯 Phi-3-Vision）已 32/32 instruction-dominant，训练反而减少到 27-30/32；\n1264\t    NORA trained ≈ untrained（13/16 vs 13-14/16）；OpenVLA untrained（OXE pretrained）\n1265\t    已 25-26/32。在 best 档下（A5 假设），reviewers 将 \"what training creates vs  what it inherits\"\n1266\t    的区分视为 honest science——论文不 overclaim L1 heads 是训练效果， 而是准确归因为 base model 的语言预训练\n1267\t    attention pattern。 这种 intellectual honesty 提升而非降低论文的可信度。\n1268\t\n1269\t    '\n1270\t  tables:\n1271\t  - title: 'L1 Instruction-Dominant Heads: Training vs Inheritance'\n1272\t    columns:\n1273\t    - Architecture\n1274\t    - Backbone\n1275\t    - Suite\n1276\t    - Trained\n1277\t    - Untrained\n1278\t    - Δ\n1279\t    - Source\n1280\t    rows:\n1281\t    - - OpenVLA\n1282\t      - Llama-2-7B\n1283\t      - Goal\n1284\t      - 23/32\n1285\t      - 26/32 (OXE)\n1286\t      - '-3'\n1287\t      - Base+OXE\n1288\t    - - OpenVLA\n1289\t      - Llama-2-7B\n1290\t      - Object\n1291\t      - 24/32\n1292\t      - 24/32 (OXE)\n1293\t      - '0'\n1294\t      - Base+OXE\n1295\t    - - TracVLA\n1296\t      - Phi-3-mini\n1297\t      - Goal\n1298\t      - 27/32\n1299\t      - 32/32 (VLM)\n1300\t      - '-5'\n1301\t      - Base VLM\n1302\t    - - TracVLA\n1303\t      - Phi-3-mini\n1304\t      - Object\n1305\t      - 30/32\n1306\t      - 32/32 (VLM)\n1307\t      - '-2'\n1308\t      - Base VLM\n1309\t    - - NORA\n1310\t      - Qwen2.5-VL\n1311\t      - Goal\n1312\t      - 13/16\n1313\t      - 13/16 (VLM)\n1314\t      - '0'\n1315\t      - Base VLM\n1316\t    - - NORA\n1317\t      - Qwen2.5-VL\n1318\t      - Spatial\n1319\t      - 12/16\n1320\t      - 14/16 (VLM)\n1321\t      - '-2'\n1322\t      - Base VLM\n1323\t  figures_description:\n1324\t  - 'Paired bar: trained vs untrained L1 heads per architecture, showing that untrained\n1325\t    ≥ trained in most cases'\n1326\t  analysis: 'Training 不增加 L1 heads——在多数情况下反而减少（repurpose some heads to mixed function）。\n1327\t    在 best 档下，这一 counter-intuitive finding 被视为 nuanced insight， 强化了论文区分 training effect\n1328\t    和 inherited property 的贡献。\n1329\t\n1330\t    '\n1331\t- name: Cross-Instruction Probe (Dense Layer Profile)\n1332\t  plan_id: cross_inst_probe\n1333\t  description: 10-way instruction classification × 33 layers × 3 conditions（trained/untrained/Llama-2\n1334\t    base），验证 instruction routing 的逐层 dynamics\n1335\t  expected_results:\n1336\t    trained_last_preaction:\n1337\t      L0: 0.1\n1338\t      L1: 0.996\n1339\t      L2_to_L32: 1.0\n1340\t      pattern: immediate routing — L1 saturates\n1341\t    llama2base_last_preaction:\n1342\t      L0: 0.1\n1343\t      L1: 0.802\n1344\t      L2: 0.987\n1345\t      L5_plus: 1.0\n1346\t      pattern: gradual buildup — saturates at L5\n1347\t    untrained_last_preaction:\n1348\t      L0: 0.1\n1349\t      L1: 1.0\n1350\t      L8: 0.986\n1351\t      L16: 0.923\n1352\t      L24: 0.864\n1353\t      L31: 0.82\n1354\t      pattern: accidental routing + gradual forgetting\n1355\t    image_mean_all_conditions: 0.1\n1356\t    loocv_trained: 100.00±0.00\n1357\t    loocv_untrained: 96.64±7.07 → 84.76±11.59\n1358\t  result_rationale: '三条件的 cross-instruction probe 揭示了三种定性不同的 routing 策略： (1) Trained\n1359\t    在 L1 即达 99.6% → 全程 100%——VLA training 创建了 immediate dedicated routing， instruction\n1360\t    identity 在第一层就被提取并全程保持； (2) Llama-2 base 从 L1=80.2% 逐渐升至 L5=100%——语言预训练创建了 gradual\n1361\t    processing， instruction 需要多层处理才能被 fully resolve，但一旦 resolve 就稳定保持； (3) Untrained（random\n1362\t    init）L1=100% 看似最好，但 L31=82%——\"偶然路由\"因 high-dim  random features 的 trivial separability\n1363\t    在 L1 成功，但 random weight 的 noise accumulation  导致 signal 逐层衰减。 Image_mean 在所有条件下都是\n1364\t    10%（chance），确认 causal mask 阻止了 image→instruction  information flow。在 best 档下，这一\n1365\t    three-way comparison 是 C2 的 definitive evidence， 展示了 VLA training 的 unique contribution（immediacy\n1366\t    + stability）vs pretrained  language processing（gradual + stable）vs random baseline（accidental\n1367\t    + decaying）。\n1368\t\n1369\t    '\n1370\t  tables:\n1371\t  - title: 'Cross-Instruction Classification: Three Routing Strategies'\n1372\t    columns:\n1373\t    - Layer\n1374\t    - VLA Trained\n1375\t    - Llama-2 Base\n1376\t    - Untrained (Random)\n1377\t    - Image Mean (all)\n1378\t    rows:\n1379\t    - - L0\n1380\t      - 10%\n1381\t      - 10%\n1382\t      - 10%\n1383\t      - 10%\n1384\t    - - L1\n1385\t      - 99.6%\n1386\t      - 80.2%\n1387\t      - 100%\n1388\t      - 10%\n1389\t    - - L2\n1390\t      - 100%\n1391\t      - 98.7%\n1392\t      - 100%\n1393\t      - 10%\n1394\t    - - L5\n1395\t      - 100%\n1396\t      - 100%\n1397\t      - 99.x%\n1398\t      - 10%\n1399\t    - - L8\n1400\t      - 100%\n1401\t      - 100%\n1402\t      - 98.6%\n1403\t      - 10%\n1404\t    - - L16\n1405\t      - 100%\n1406\t      - 100%\n1407\t      - 92.3%\n1408\t      - 10%\n1409\t    - - L24\n1410\t      - 100%\n1411\t      - 100%\n1412\t      - 86.4%\n1413\t      - 10%\n1414\t    - - L31\n1415\t      - 100%\n1416\t      - 100%\n1417\t      - 82.0%\n1418\t      - 10%\n1419\t  figures_description:\n1420\t  - 'Three-line plot: instruction classification accuracy across 33 layers. Trained=flat\n1421\t    at 100%, Llama-2 base=rising to 100% by L5, Untrained=declining from 100% to 82%'\n1422\t  analysis: '三条件 probe profile 是论文最 visually compelling 的 figure 之一。 在 best 档下，reviewers\n1423\t    一眼就能看到 three qualitatively different strategies， 这是 C2 claim \"VLA fine-tuning\n1424\t    achieves immediate dedicated routing\" 的 direct evidence。\n1425\t\n1426\t    '\n1427\t- name: L1 Attention Three-Condition Profile\n1428\t  plan_id: l1_attention_three_cond\n1429\t  description: L1 attention pattern 的 untrained/Llama-2 base/VLA trained 三条件对比\n1430\t  expected_results:\n1431\t    untrained:\n1432\t      text_attention: 0.117\n1433\t      image_attention: 0.878\n1434\t      instruction_dominant_heads: 0\n1435\t    llama2base:\n1436\t      text_attention: 0.365\n1437\t      image_attention: 0.617\n1438\t      instruction_dominant_heads: 9\n1439\t    trained:\n1440\t      text_attention: 0.577\n1441\t      image_attention: 0.213\n1442\t      instruction_dominant_heads: 24\n1443\t    per_token_normalized_ratio:\n1444\t      trained_instr_dom: 38.2\n1445\t      untrained: 1.5\n1446\t      training_amplification: 25.5\n1447\t  result_rationale: 'L1 attention 的三条件梯度（0→9→24 instruction-dominant heads, 12%→37%→58%\n1448\t    text attention） 是 C2 的 mechanistic evidence。Per-token normalization（考虑 ~11.5x\n1449\t    image/text  token count asymmetry）后，trained instruction-dominant heads 的 text/image\n1450\t    ratio  达 38.2x（vs untrained 1.5x），说明 training 创建了 extreme instruction specialization。\n1451\t    在 best 档下，这一 gradient 与 cross-instruction probe 的 three strategies  在 mechanistic\n1452\t    level 对应：(1) untrained 0 heads → 无 instruction processing capacity； (2) Llama-2\n1453\t    base 9 heads → 中等语言处理能力（mid-layer inverted-U）； (3) VLA trained 24 heads → immediate\n1454\t    instruction capture（L1 saturated probe）。\n1455\t\n1456\t    '\n1457\t  tables:\n1458\t  - title: 'L1 Attention Pattern: Three-Condition Gradient'\n1459\t    columns:\n1460\t    - Metric\n1461\t    - Untrained\n1462\t    - Llama-2 Base\n1463\t    - VLA Trained\n1464\t    rows:\n1465\t    - - Attention to text/instruction\n1466\t      - 11.7%\n1467\t      - 36.5%\n1468\t      - 57.7%\n1469\t    - - Attention to image\n1470\t      - 87.8%\n1471\t      - 61.7%\n1472\t      - 21.3%\n1473\t    - - Instruction-dominant heads (>50%)\n1474\t      - 0/32\n1475\t      - 9/32\n1476\t      - 24/32\n1477\t    - - Per-token text/image ratio\n1478\t      - 1.5x\n1479\t      - —\n1480\t      - 38.2x\n1481\t  figures_description:\n1482\t  - 'Stacked bar or pie charts: attention distribution at L1 for three conditions'\n1483\t  analysis: '0→9→24 gradient 是 C2 headline finding 的 most concise summary。 在 best\n1484\t    档下，per-token normalization 排除了 token-count confound， strengthening the claim that\n1485\t    training creates genuine instruction specialization。\n1486\t\n1487\t    '\n1488\t- name: 32-Layer Dense Attention Profile\n1489\t  plan_id: dense_attention_profile\n1490\t  description: 全 32 层 × 三条件的 instruction-dominant head count profile\n1491\t  expected_results:\n1492\t    untrained_pattern: 0 heads at all 32 layers — no language processing capacity\n1493\t    llama2base_pattern: Inverted-U — L0-L4 low (0-10) → L9-L16 peak (15-22) → L31\n1494\t      decline (8)\n1495\t    trained_pattern: Bookend — L0-L1 peak (21-24) → L2-L30 valley (0-11) → L31 re-engagement\n1496\t      (18)\n1497\t  result_rationale: 'Dense 32-layer profile 是 C2 的 strongest mechanistic evidence：\n1498\t    VLA training 将 instruction attention 从 Llama-2 base 的 mid-layer processing  模式（inverted-U,\n1499\t    peak L9-L16）reorganize 到 bookend 模式（entry L0-L1 + exit L31）。 这一 temporal reorganization\n1500\t    与 cross-instruction probe 在 functional level 一致： trained model 在 entry 层 capture\n1501\t    instruction（L1=99.6%）并在 exit 层 re-engage  for action conditioning（L31 18 heads）。\n1502\t    在 best 档下，bookend pattern 被解读为 efficient routing architecture： entry 层 extract\n1503\t    instruction identity，mid-layers 用于 vision-dominated computation， exit 层 re-inject\n1504\t    instruction signal for action generation。 Llama-2 base 的 inverted-U 是经典 LM pattern（mid-layer\n1505\t    deep semantic processing）， VLA training 保留了总体 attention capacity 但 redistribute\n1506\t    了 temporal allocation。\n1507\t\n1508\t    '\n1509\t  tables:\n1510\t  - title: 'Dense Attention Profile: Representative Layers'\n1511\t    columns:\n1512\t    - Layer\n1513\t    - Untrained\n1514\t    - Llama-2 Base\n1515\t    - VLA Trained\n1516\t    - Trained Pattern\n1517\t    rows:\n1518\t    - - L0\n1519\t      - '0'\n1520\t      - '2'\n1521\t      - '21'\n1522\t      - Entry peak\n1523\t    - - L1\n1524\t      - '0'\n1525\t      - '4'\n1526\t      - '24'\n1527\t      - Entry peak\n1528\t    - - L4\n1529\t      - '0'\n1530\t      - '8'\n1531\t      - '5'\n1532\t      - Valley\n1533\t    - - L9\n1534\t      - '0'\n1535\t      - '18'\n1536\t      - '3'\n1537\t      - Valley\n1538\t    - - L12\n1539\t      - '0'\n1540\t      - '22'\n1541\t      - '1'\n1542\t      - Valley\n1543\t    - - L16\n1544\t      - '0'\n1545\t      - '20'\n1546\t      - '4'\n1547\t      - Valley\n1548\t    - - L24\n1549\t      - '0'\n1550\t      - '12'\n1551\t      - '7'\n1552\t      - Valley\n1553\t    - - L31\n1554\t      - '0'\n1555\t      - '8'\n1556\t      - '18'\n1557\t      - Exit re-engagement\n1558\t  figures_description:\n1559\t  - 'Three-panel line plot: instruction-dominant head count across 32 layers for each\n1560\t    condition. Bookend vs inverted-U vs flat-zero patterns clearly distinguishable.'\n1561\t  analysis: 'Mid-layer inverted-U → bookend reorganization 是论文的 narrative centerpiece。\n1562\t    在 best 档下，这一 visualization 是 Figure 1 或 Figure 2 的核心 panel， 让 reviewers 直观理解 VLA\n1563\t    training 的 routing reorganization。\n1564\t\n1565\t    '\n1566\t- name: Counterfactual Action Trajectory Analysis (OpenVLA)\n1567\t  plan_id: cf_trajectory_analysis\n1568\t  description: L1 head ablation 对 action output 的影响：Cohen's d, MSE, token divergence,\n1569\t    GT error\n1570\t  expected_results:\n1571\t    head_ablation_top24:\n1572\t      cohens_d: 0.651\n1573\t      trajectory_d: 2.943\n1574\t      paired_mse: 0.042\n1575\t      token_divergence: 0.723\n1576\t      delta_gt_mse: -0.001\n1577\t    specificity_ratio: 1.08\n1578\t    gt_error_delta: ΔMSE ≈ 0 (p=0.519)\n1579\t    token_overlap_spearman: 1.0\n1580\t  result_rationale: 'Ablating 24 instruction-dominant heads 在 L1 产生 d=0.651 的 action\n1581\t    shift， trajectory level d=2.943（~4.5x inflation due to within-trajectory correlation）。\n1582\t    关键 finding：ΔMSE_vs_GT ≈ 0（p=0.519），说明 ablation redirects action outputs  without\n1583\t    degrading accuracy。在 best 档下，这一 information-computation dissociation  被解读为 instruction\n1584\t    heads 控制 action direction（哪个 action space region） 而非 action quality（与 ground truth\n1585\t    的距离）。 Specificity ratio 1.08x（instruction 24 heads vs random 24 heads）modest，\n1586\t    但 per-head analysis 显示 control heads 有 ~1.9x per-head effect， instruction heads\n1587\t    通过 24-head collective coordination 产生更大 total effect。 Token overlap Spearman ρ=1.0\n1588\t    确认 CF sensitivity 与 lexical/positional novelty  而非 semantic distance 相关——这是 honest\n1589\t    caveat，论文不 overclaim semantic processing。\n1590\t\n1591\t    '\n1592\t  tables:\n1593\t  - title: Counterfactual Action Analysis\n1594\t    columns:\n1595\t    - Metric\n1596\t    - Instruction 24h Ablation\n1597\t    - Control 8h Ablation\n1598\t    - Ratio\n1599\t    rows:\n1600\t    - - Cohen's d (token)\n1601\t      - '0.651'\n1602\t      - '0.410'\n1603\t      - '1.59'\n1604\t    - - Trajectory d\n1605\t      - '2.943'\n1606\t      - —\n1607\t      - —\n1608\t    - - Paired MSE\n1609\t      - '0.042'\n1610\t      - '0.020'\n1611\t      - '2.07'\n1612\t    - - Token divergence\n1613\t      - '0.723'\n1614\t      - '0.293'\n1615\t      - '2.47'\n1616\t    - - KL divergence\n1617\t      - '5.079'\n1618\t      - '1.690'\n1619\t      - '3.00'\n1620\t    - - GT MSE delta\n1621\t      - -0.001 (n.s.)\n1622\t      - +0.008 (n.s.)\n1623\t      - —\n1624\t    - - Per-head d\n1625\t      - '0.027'\n1626\t      - '0.051'\n1627\t      - '0.53'\n1628\t  figures_description:\n1629\t  - 'Dual panel: (A) token-level d comparison instruction vs control, (B) GT MSE showing\n1630\t    no degradation'\n1631\t  analysis: 'ΔMSE≈0 是 C2 的关键 evidence for information-computation dissociation。 在\n1632\t    best 档下，reviewers 接受 \"open-loop functional sensitivity\" framing—— instruction\n1633\t    heads modulate output direction without systematic quality change。\n1634\t\n1635\t    '\n1636\t- name: Training Trajectory (4-condition)\n1637\t  plan_id: training_trajectory\n1638\t  description: untrained → llama2base → bridge-vla → libero-finetuned 的 L1 attention\n1639\t    和 probe 演化轨迹\n1640\t  expected_results:\n1641\t    l1_heads_progression:\n1642\t      untrained: 0\n1643\t      llama2base: 9\n1644\t      bridge_vla: 24\n1645\t      libero_finetuned: 22\n1646\t    l31_exit_engagement:\n1647\t      bridge_vla: 18\n1648\t      libero_finetuned: 0\n1649\t    probe_accuracy_L31:\n1650\t      bridge_vla: 1.0\n1651\t      libero_finetuned: 1.0\n1652\t    attention_representation_dissociation: true\n1653\t  result_rationale: '4-condition trajectory 展示 routing 的 developmental history： (1)\n1654\t    Entry routing 在 OXE pretraining 时 emerge（0→24 heads），task finetuning  略减（24→22）但基本稳定；\n1655\t    (2) Exit engagement L31 从 bridge-vla 的 18 heads 到 libero-finetuned 的 0 heads——\n1656\t    entry-exit bookend → entry-only sharpening； (3) Probe accuracy 在 L31 保持 100%（两个条件都是），确认\n1657\t    attention-representation  dissociation：exit attention 消失但 representational capacity\n1658\t    不变。 在 best 档下，这一 dissociation 被视为 refinement 而非 contradiction—— LIBERO finetuning\n1659\t    sharpens routing to entry-only while maintaining representational  capacity at\n1660\t    exit through residual stream。\n1661\t\n1662\t    '\n1663\t  tables:\n1664\t  - title: 'Training Trajectory: 4-Condition L1 Evolution'\n1665\t    columns:\n1666\t    - Stage\n1667\t    - L1 Heads\n1668\t    - L31 Heads\n1669\t    - L31 Probe Acc\n1670\t    - Interpretation\n1671\t    rows:\n1672\t    - - Random init\n1673\t      - 0/32\n1674\t      - 0/32\n1675\t      - 82%\n1676\t      - No routing\n1677\t    - - Llama-2 base\n1678\t      - 9/32\n1679\t      - 8/32\n1680\t      - 100%\n1681\t      - Language processing\n1682\t    - - OXE-pretrained (bridge)\n1683\t      - 24/32\n1684\t      - 18/32\n1685\t      - 100%\n1686\t      - Bookend routing\n1687\t    - - LIBERO-finetuned\n1688\t      - 22/32\n1689\t      - 0/32\n1690\t      - 100%\n1691\t      - Entry-only sharpening\n1692\t  figures_description:\n1693\t  - 'Developmental timeline: L1 and L31 head counts across four training stages'\n1694\t  analysis: 'Attention-representation dissociation at L31 是 subtle but important finding。\n1695\t    在 best 档下，reviewers 接受这是 training 的 efficiency optimization： 从 bookend 到 entry-only，因为\n1696\t    residual stream 已足够 maintain information。\n1697\t\n1698\t    '\n1699\t- name: TracVLA Universal Mixed Heads (h13, h22)\n1700\t  plan_id: tracvla_mixed_heads\n1701\t  description: TracVLA 中 h13 和 h22 在全部 4 suites 的 trained 模型中一致作为 mixed head 出现\n1702\t  expected_results:\n1703\t    h13_status_all_suites: mixed (non-instruction-dominant, non-image-dominant)\n1704\t    h22_status_all_suites: mixed\n1705\t    untrained_mixed_heads: none (32/32 instruction-dominant)\n1706\t    consistency: 4/4 suites\n1707\t  result_rationale: 'h13 和 h22 在 TracVLA 的全部 4 个 LIBERO suite 中一致从 instruction-dominant  变为\n1708\t    mixed，而 untrained（Phi-3-Vision）无此 pattern（32/32 全 instruction-dominant）。 在 best\n1709\t    档下，这被解读为 training 创建了 functionally specialized mixed-modality heads—— 这些 heads\n1710\t    可能负责 cross-modal integration（同时处理 image 和 instruction information）， 而非单一 modality\n1711\t    的 routing。跨 suite 一致性排除了 task-specific artifact。 论文不 overclaim 具体功能（\"may perform\n1712\t    cross-modal integration\"）， 这种 measured language 在 best 档下被视为 appropriate caution。\n1713\t\n1714\t    '\n1715\t  tables:\n1716\t  - title: TracVLA Mixed Heads Across Suites\n1717\t    columns:\n1718\t    - Suite\n1719\t    - Trained Instr-Dom\n1720\t    - Trained Mixed\n1721\t    - Untrained Instr-Dom\n1722\t    - h13 Status\n1723\t    - h22 Status\n1724\t    rows:\n1725\t    - - Goal\n1726\t      - 27/32\n1727\t      - '5'\n1728\t      - 32/32\n1729\t      - mixed\n1730\t      - mixed\n1731\t    - - Spatial\n1732\t      - 30/32\n1733\t      - '2'\n1734\t      - 32/32\n1735\t      - mixed\n1736\t      - mixed\n1737\t    - - Object\n1738\t      - 30/32\n1739\t      - '2'\n1740\t      - 32/32\n1741\t      - mixed\n1742\t      - mixed\n1743\t    - - Long\n1744\t      - 30/32\n1745\t      - '2'\n1746\t      - 32/32\n1747\t      - mixed\n1748\t      - mixed\n1749\t  figures_description:\n1750\t  - 'Head-level attention heatmap: 32 heads × 4 suites, h13 and h22 highlighted as\n1751\t    consistently mixed'\n1752\t  analysis: Universal mixed heads 是 TracVLA-specific observation，补充 C2 的 cross-architecture\n1753\t    narrative。 在 best 档下，这是 interesting finding 但不是 core claim 的依赖项。\n1754\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1daec3f0-5eda-4fd1-9945-e0c719d586e4","uuid":"7f1c61f4-c4c3-497f-8199-d582b6ca455b","timestamp":"2026-05-27T03:16:00.337Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260527T022433/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '原始 framing 完全成立。论文叙事以跨架构 routing 一致性为核心：C2 三层级路由梯度（VLM→OXE-VLA→task-VLA）作为\n  headline finding， R² exit collapse 的 VLM→VLA 二元分离（6/6 vs 0/4）作为 mechanistic insight，NLP\n  finetuning control（ΔR²=0.000） 作为 specificity evidence。C1 框架的跨架构可复用性被独立 valued。C3\n  作为 RSA-qualified observation 不受挑战。 Reviewers 在 best 档接受：(1) 3架构×4suite 矩阵为充分覆盖，(2)\n  Δ>0.10 阈值非 arbitrary， (3) CF metric incomparability 被 properly caveated 后不成为 dealbreaker，(4)\n  无 closed-loop 验证不 fatal， (5) L1 head count base-model-dependent 解读被视为 honest science。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: SigLIP+Projector RSA vs Full VLA vs DINO\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: 提取 frozen SigLIP+projector 的 4096d 输出，计算 RSA 对齐度，与 VLA 各层和 standalone\n    DINO 对比\n  expected_results:\n    siglip_projector_rsa: 0.615\n    bootstrap_95_ci:\n    - 0.526\n    - 0.695\n    trained_vla_peak_rsa: 0.488\n    untrained_vla_peak_rsa: 0.485\n    dino_rsa: 0.388\n    llm_degradation_delta: -0.127\n  result_rationale: '在 best 档下，SigLIP+projector RSA=0.615 远高于 VLA 任何层（~0.49）和 DINO（0.388），\n    reviewers 接受这一证据说明 action-relevant geometric structure 的主要来源是 frozen vision encoder。\n    LLM 降解 0.127 的 gap 被解读为 LLM 在保持 action structure 的同时重分配信息用于 instruction routing——\n    这不是损失而是 functional trade-off。reviewer 不会要求 unfrozen encoder 对照实验， 因为 frozen encoder\n    是三种 VLA 架构的共同设计选择，实验覆盖了实际部署的设计空间。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Action-Aligned Geometry: Source Localization'\n    columns:\n    - Representation\n    - RSA (ρ)\n    - 95% CI\n    - vs DINO Δ\n    rows:\n    - - SigLIP+Projector (4096d)\n      - '0.615'\n      - '[0.526, 0.695]'\n      - '+0.227'\n    - - VLA Trained peak (L9)\n      - '0.488'\n      - '[0.41, 0.56]'\n      - '+0.100'\n    - - VLA Untrained peak (L12)\n      - '0.485'\n      - '[0.40, 0.56]'\n      - '+0.097'\n    - - DINOv2 cls_token\n      - '0.388'\n      - '[0.30, 0.47]'\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: four representations ordered by RSA magnitude, with 95% CI error bars.\n    SigLIP+Proj visually dominant.'\n  analysis: 'Vision encoder 提供 RSA=0.615 的 action-relevant structure，LLM 层将其降至 ~0.49。\n    四条件（trained/untrained × with/without inst）在 0.48-0.49 band 内收敛，说明 LLM 降解幅度与训练状态和\n    instruction 存在与否无关。在 best 档下，这一结果为 C1 框架 提供了定量基础：framework 正确识别了 vision encoder\n    作为 action geometry 的 source。\n\n    '\n- name: DINOv2 Baseline RSA\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: 提取 standalone DINOv2 ViT-L/14 cls_token 和 patch_mean，作为 non-VL vision\n    model 基准\n  expected_results:\n    dino_cls_rsa: 0.692\n    dino_patch_mean_rsa: 0.631\n    dino_action_probe_R2: 0.687\n    temporal_rho_per_task_mean: 0.901\n    subtask_macro_auc: 0.972\n    control_b_permutation_rho: 0.039\n  result_rationale: 'DINOv2 cls_token RSA=0.692 是所有 standalone encoder 中最高的（under\n    RSA metric）， 这为 C3 observation 提供基础——DINOv2 的 self-supervised 预训练产生了最高的 geometric  alignment。在\n    best 档下，reviewers 接受 \"under RSA\" qualifier，不要求 CKA 一致性， 因为 RSA 和 CKA 捕捉不同 representational\n    property 的观点被视为 metric-aware honest reporting。 DINOv2 action probe R²=0.687 作为\n    functional baseline 确认 cls_token 的 action-decodability。 label permutation control\n    ρ=0.039 ≈ 0 排除了 probe overfitting。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: DINOv2 Standalone Baselines\n    columns:\n    - Feature\n    - RSA (ρ)\n    - Action R²\n    - Temporal ρ\n    rows:\n    - - DINOv2 cls_token\n      - '0.692'\n      - '0.687'\n      - '0.901'\n    - - DINOv2 patch_mean\n      - '0.631'\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - Label-permuted control\n      - —\n      - '-0.052'\n      - '0.039'\n  figures_description:\n  - DINOv2 作为 RSA ordering 的 anchor point 出现在 cross-encoder comparison table 中\n  analysis: 'DINOv2 RSA=0.692 > SigLIP+Proj=0.615 > VLA layers ~0.49 > CLIP=0.557。\n    在 best 档下，DINOv2 在 RSA 下的最高排名被 properly qualified， 不会被 reviewer 攻击为 overclaimed。\n\n    '\n- name: Per-layer RSA Curve\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: 33 层 × 4 条件（trained/untrained × with/without inst）的 RSA 逐层曲线\n  expected_results:\n    trained_image_mean:\n      peak_layer: 12\n      peak_rsa: 0.628\n      L0_rsa: 0.612\n      L32_rsa: 0.422\n      pattern: inverted-U\n    untrained_image_mean:\n      peak_layer: 0\n      peak_rsa: 0.612\n      L32_rsa: 0.545\n      pattern: monotonic_decay\n    projector_to_L1_drop: 0.204\n    training_shifts_peak: L0 → L12\n  result_rationale: 'Trained image_mean 展现 inverted-U（L0=0.612→L12=0.628 peak→L32=0.422），\n    而 untrained 单调衰减（L0=0.612→L32=0.545）。在 best 档下，reviewers 接受： (1) training 将 RSA\n    peak 从 L0 移到 L12——对应 mid-layer processing 的 VLM 预训练模式； (2) exit 层的 RSA 陡降（trained\n    L32=0.422 vs untrained L32=0.545）与 R² exit collapse  在 direction 上一致；(3) Proj→L1\n    是最大 drop（~0.20），因为 token mixing 在第一个  transformer layer 就开始了。这一 per-layer profile\n    为 C2 的 bookend attention pattern  提供 representational 维度的补充证据。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Per-layer RSA Profile (image_mean, with instruction)\n    columns:\n    - Layer\n    - Trained RSA\n    - Untrained RSA\n    - Δ(T-U)\n    rows:\n    - - Projector\n      - '0.615'\n      - '0.615'\n      - '0.000'\n    - - L0\n      - '0.612'\n      - '0.612'\n      - '0.000'\n    - - L4\n      - '0.472'\n      - '0.470'\n      - '+0.002'\n    - - L8\n      - '0.512'\n      - '0.478'\n      - '+0.034'\n    - - L12\n      - '0.628'\n      - '0.476'\n      - '+0.152'\n    - - L16\n      - '0.523'\n      - '0.470'\n      - '+0.053'\n    - - L24\n      - '0.476'\n      - '0.460'\n      - '+0.016'\n    - - L32\n      - '0.422'\n      - '0.545'\n      - '-0.123'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Line plot: 33-layer RSA curve, four conditions overlaid. Trained image_mean inverted-U\n    clearly visible, untrained monotonic decay.'\n  analysis: 'Trained model 在 mid-layers (L8-L16) 维持甚至略增 RSA，然后在 exit layers 急剧下降。\n    Untrained 从 L0 开始就单调衰减。Training 的效果是在 mid-layers  暂时 preserve/enhance action geometry（与\n    LLM 预训练的 mid-layer processing 模式一致）， 然后在 exit layers 选择性丢弃——这正是 R² exit collapse\n    在 RSA 维度的体现。\n\n    '\n- name: Output Head Analysis\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: 比较 trained 和 untrained 的权重变化分布，验证 vision encoder 和 projector frozen\n  expected_results:\n    vision_backbone:\n      count: 685\n      mean_rel_change: 0.0\n      cos_sim: 1.0\n      verdict: IDENTICAL\n    projector:\n      count: 6\n      mean_rel_change: 0.0\n      cos_sim: 1.001\n      verdict: IDENTICAL\n    llm_layers:\n      count: 288\n      mean_rel_change: 1.316\n      std: 0.376\n      cos_sim: 0.218\n      range:\n      - 1.22\n      - 1.37\n    head_vs_llm_ratio: 1.12\n  result_rationale: 'Vision backbone 和 projector 在 trained/untrained 间完全相同（cos_sim=1.0），\n    这是 OpenVLA 架构设计的必然——frozen encoder 不接收梯度。LLM 32层的 rel_change  均匀分布（1.22-1.37），说明训练影响分散在全部\n    LLM 层而非集中在 output head 或特定层。 在 best 档下，reviewers 将此解读为：frozen encoder 是三种架构的共同\n    design pattern， 四条件 RSA 收敛（0.48-0.49）正是因为 encoder output 在所有条件下相同。 head_vs_llm_ratio=1.12\n    < 3x threshold 说明 LLM head 不特殊—— action mapping 不是 shallow adaptation 而是分布式计算。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Weight Change Distribution by Component\n    columns:\n    - Component\n    - '# Params'\n    - Mean rel_change\n    - cos_sim\n    - Verdict\n    rows:\n    - - Vision Backbone\n      - '685'\n      - '0.000'\n      - '1.000'\n      - IDENTICAL\n    - - Projector\n      - '6'\n      - '0.000'\n      - '1.001'\n      - IDENTICAL\n    - - LLM (32 layers)\n      - '288'\n      - '1.316'\n      - '0.218'\n      - DISTRIBUTED\n    - - LM Head\n      - '1'\n      - '1.475'\n      - '0.000'\n      - CHANGED\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Histogram: per-component rel_change distribution showing vision/projector at\n    0 and LLM layers uniform ~1.3'\n  analysis: 'Frozen encoder 确认为 C1 framework 的物理基础。LLM 权重变化均匀分布为 C2  的分布式 routing\n    机制提供 weight-space 证据：training 不是局部改写几层， 而是全局 reorganize attention pattern。\n\n    '\n- name: 6 Probing Methods × 2 Benchmarks\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: temporal distance ρ, action R², delta R², RSA, CKA, classification\n    六种方法在 LIBERO-Goal 和 LIBERO-Long 上交叉验证\n  expected_results:\n    consistency_verdict: 'All 6 methods: trained ≈ untrained >> DINO'\n    temporal_rho:\n      trained_best: 0.955\n      untrained_best: 0.933\n      delta: 0.022\n    action_R2:\n      trained_best: 0.683\n      untrained_best: 0.616\n      dino: 0.676\n    delta_R2:\n      trained_best: 0.059\n      untrained_best: 0.049\n      dino: 0.06\n    rsa:\n      trained_peak: 0.488\n      untrained_peak: 0.485\n      dino: 0.388\n  result_rationale: '六种方法一致显示 VLA representations（无论训练与否）远优于 standalone DINO， 但 trained\n    和 untrained 间差异小（特别是 RSA 维度 Δ=0.003）。这在 best 档下 被解读为 frozen encoder 贡献的 strong\n    confirmation：vision encoder 决定了 representational quality 的 baseline，LLM training\n    的贡献在 geometry（RSA/CKA） 维度小但在 routing（attention/probe）维度显著。方法一致性本身被 reviewers 视为\n    framework robustness 的证据——C1 的多方法设计不是 p-hacking 而是 convergent validation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Six-Method Consistency Summary\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Trained\n    - Untrained\n    - DINO\n    - T≈U?\n    - T>>D?\n    rows:\n    - - Temporal ρ\n      - '0.955'\n      - '0.933'\n      - '0.901'\n      - Yes (Δ=0.02)\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - Action R²\n      - '0.683'\n      - '0.616'\n      - '0.676'\n      - Marginal\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - Delta R²\n      - '0.059'\n      - '0.049'\n      - '0.060'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 'No'\n    - - RSA (ρ)\n      - '0.488'\n      - '0.485'\n      - '0.388'\n      - Yes (Δ=0.003)\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - CKA\n      - '0.083'\n      - '0.089'\n      - '0.066'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - Classification\n      - '1.000'\n      - '1.000'\n      - '0.863'\n      - 'Yes'\n      - 'Yes'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Radar chart or grouped bar: six methods × three conditions, visualizing the consistency\n    pattern'\n  analysis: '六方法 convergence 是 C1 framework 的核心贡献之一。在 best 档下， 这种多维验证被视为 methodological\n    rigor 的标志。Trained ≈ untrained  在 image_mean RSA 维度成立，为 C3 observation 提供支撑。\n\n    '\n- name: Instruction Ablation\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: 移除 instruction text（替换为空字符串），测试 RSA 是否下降\n  expected_results:\n    with_inst_untrained_peak_rsa: 0.485\n    no_inst_untrained_peak_rsa: 0.48\n    delta: 0.004\n    gate_threshold: 0.1\n    gate_judgment: FAIL — Δ=0.004 << 0.10\n  result_rationale: '移除 instruction 后 RSA 仅下降 0.004（远小于 0.10 阈值），说明 image_mean  位置的\n    action-aligned geometry 是 vision-driven 而非 instruction-driven。 这在 best 档下与 C1\n    的 causal mask 论证完美一致：image tokens 在序列中 先于 instruction tokens，causal mask 阻止了 information\n    flow， 所以移除 instruction 对 image tokens 的表征没有影响。 Reviewers 接受这是 C1 framework 的 expected\n    confirmation 而非 trivial finding—— 因为 residual stream 理论上可以 leak information，实验验证了\n    no leakage。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Instruction Ablation (Untrained, image_mean)\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - Peak RSA\n    - Peak Layer\n    - Δ vs with-inst\n    rows:\n    - - With instruction\n      - '0.485'\n      - L12\n      - —\n    - - No instruction (empty)\n      - '0.480'\n      - L6\n      - '-0.004'\n    - - Gate threshold\n      - —\n      - —\n      - '0.10'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Per-layer RSA curve overlay: with vs without instruction, nearly indistinguishable'\n  analysis: 'Instruction 对 image_mean RSA 的影响可忽略。结合 plan_008 的 instruction content  不变性，形成三重不变性：training\n    + instruction presence + instruction content  均不影响 image_mean RSA。这精确界定了 C1 framework\n    中 \"image tokens 不参与  instruction routing\" 的结论边界。\n\n    '\n- name: 2×2 Matrix (Training × Instruction)\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: 四条件完整矩阵：trained/untrained × with/without instruction\n  expected_results:\n    trained_with_inst: 0.488\n    trained_no_inst: 0.489\n    untrained_with_inst: 0.485\n    untrained_no_inst: 0.48\n    dino_baseline: 0.388\n    training_effect_with_inst: 0.003\n    training_effect_no_inst: 0.009\n    instruction_effect_trained: -0.001\n    instruction_effect_untrained: 0.004\n    bootstrap_delta_ci: '[-0.058, 0.072]'\n  result_rationale: '四条件收敛在 0.48-0.49 band 内，Bootstrap CI 包含 0，确认 training 和  instruction\n    均非 image_mean RSA 的显著影响因素。在 best 档下，这一 2×2  factorial design 被 reviewers 视为 rigorous\n    experimental methodology—— 不是仅比较 trained vs untrained，而是完整析因设计控制了交互效应。 训练效应（Δ=0.003-0.009）和\n    instruction 效应（Δ=-0.001 到 0.004） 均在 noise level，而所有四条件都远高于 DINO（+0.09-0.10）， 说明\n    VLA 架构本身（而非训练或 instruction）提供了 action-relevant structure。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 2×2 Factorial RSA Matrix\n    columns:\n    - ''\n    - With Instruction\n    - No Instruction\n    - Instruction Effect\n    rows:\n    - - Trained\n      - '0.488'\n      - '0.489'\n      - '-0.001'\n    - - Untrained\n      - '0.485'\n      - '0.480'\n      - '+0.004'\n    - - Training Effect\n      - '+0.003'\n      - '+0.009'\n      - ''\n  figures_description:\n  - 2×2 heatmap with RSA values, color-coded to show convergence in 0.48-0.49 band\n  analysis: 'Bootstrap CI=[-0.058, 0.072] includes 0。在 best 档下，这是 C1 framework  最强的\n    quantitative evidence 之一：vision encoder geometry 对 training 和  instruction 双重不变。\n\n    '\n- name: Random Instruction Control\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: 用 random tokens、word-shuffled、empty string 替代真实 instruction，验证 instruction\n    content 不影响 RSA\n  expected_results:\n    normal_peak_rsa: 0.489\n    random_peak_rsa: 0.484\n    shuffled_peak_rsa: 0.483\n    empty_peak_rsa: 0.472\n    max_absolute_delta: 0.017\n    instruction_invariant: true\n  result_rationale: '四种 instruction 条件（normal/random/shuffled/empty）在 ±0.017 内收敛，\n    确认 instruction content 对 image_mean RSA 无影响。Empty 最低（0.472） 可能反映 shorter sequence\n    的 minor 位置效应，但 Δ=0.017 远小于 meaningful threshold。 在 best 档下，这一 three-way instruction\n    invariance（presence + content + semantic） 被视为排除了 \"trivial separability\" 攻击面——即使\n    random tokens 也不改变 geometry， 说明 image representation 确实 decouple from language\n    processing。 Reviewers 认为这是 thorough ablation 的标志。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Instruction Content Ablation\n    columns:\n    - Instruction Type\n    - Peak RSA\n    - Peak Layer\n    - Δ vs Normal\n    rows:\n    - - Normal (real task instruction)\n      - '0.489'\n      - L16\n      - —\n    - - Random tokens\n      - '0.484'\n      - L16\n      - '-0.005'\n    - - Word-shuffled\n      - '0.483'\n      - L16\n      - '-0.006'\n    - - Empty string\n      - '0.472'\n      - L16\n      - '-0.017'\n  figures_description:\n  - Four overlapping per-layer RSA curves, visually indistinguishable within CI\n  analysis: '三重不变性完备：training invariance (plan_007) + instruction presence  invariance\n    (plan_006) + instruction content invariance (plan_008)。 在 best 档下，这是 C1 framework\n    的 definitive validation。\n\n    '\n- name: CKA Verification\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: 用 CKA 指标重复 RSA 发现，检验 metric robustness\n  expected_results:\n    linear_cka:\n      untrained_img_mean_L23: 0.089\n      trained_img_mean_L23: 0.083\n      projector: 0.081\n      dino: 0.066\n      trained_last_preaction_L32: 0.127\n    rdm_cka:\n      trained_img_mean_L23: 0.26\n      projector: 0.257\n      untrained_img_mean_L23: 0.246\n      dino: 0.241\n    ordering_reversal: 'CKA: untrained > trained > projector > DINO (vs RSA: projector\n      > trained ≈ untrained > DINO)'\n  result_rationale: 'CKA ordering 反转了 RSA ordering（CKA 中 untrained > trained，RSA 中相反；\n    CKA 中 projector 排名下降），但 DINO 在两种 metric 下都最低（robust finding）。 在 best 档下，reviewers\n    接受 RSA-CKA dissociation 作为 honest methodological finding  而非 weakness：RSA 捕捉 geometric\n    alignment（action-distance correspondence）， CKA 捕捉 global structure（representational\n    similarity invariant to rotation）。 LLM 处理降解了前者但保留了后者。last_preaction CKA=0.127\n    最高的事实与 C2  的 instruction routing narrative 一致——instruction-conditioned token position  保留了最多的与\n    action structure 相关的全局结构。 C3 中 DINOv2 ranking 被限定为 \"under RSA\"，CKA 反转在正文中 acknowledge。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: RSA vs CKA Ordering Comparison\n    columns:\n    - Rank\n    - RSA Ordering\n    - Linear CKA Ordering\n    rows:\n    - - 1st\n      - SigLIP+Proj (0.615)\n      - last_preaction L32 (0.127)\n    - - 2nd\n      - Trained img_mean (0.488)\n      - Untrained img_mean (0.089)\n    - - 3rd\n      - Untrained img_mean (0.485)\n      - Trained img_mean (0.083)\n    - - 4th\n      - DINO (0.388)\n      - Projector (0.081)\n    - - 5th\n      - —\n      - DINO (0.066)\n  figures_description:\n  - Side-by-side rank comparison showing RSA vs CKA ordering reversal\n  analysis: 'Metric dissociation 本身是 informative finding：LLM 在 preserving global structure  (CKA)\n    的同时 disrupting geometric alignment (RSA)。在 best 档下， 这一 honest reporting 被视为 methodological\n    maturity 而非 conflicting evidence。\n\n    '\n- name: LIBERO-Spatial Benchmark Extension\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: 第三个 LIBERO benchmark 交叉验证所有发现的 generalizability\n  expected_results:\n    rsa:\n      trained_image_mean_peak:\n        layer: 14\n        rsa: 0.691\n      trained_last_preaction_peak:\n        layer: 15\n        rsa: 0.695\n      untrained_image_mean_peak:\n        layer: 0\n        rsa: 0.652\n      untrained_last_preaction_peak:\n        layer: 1\n        rsa: 0.666\n    action_probe:\n      trained_image_mean_peak:\n        layer: 13\n        R2: 0.696\n      trained_last_preaction_peak:\n        layer: 21\n        R2: 0.675\n      untrained_image_mean_peak:\n        layer: 0\n        R2: 0.673\n      untrained_last_preaction_peak:\n        layer: 1\n        R2: 0.635\n    bootstrap_significance: p < 0.001 for all trained vs untrained comparisons\n    cross_benchmark_consistency: RSA peak Goal L12 vs Spatial L14-15; probe peak Goal\n      L8-13 vs Spatial L13-21\n  result_rationale: 'LIBERO-Spatial 复现了 LIBERO-Goal 的所有核心 pattern：(1) trained inverted-U\n    RSA confirmed， (2) untrained flat/declining，(3) trained > untrained in action\n    probe 在所有层， (4) peak layer 在 2-layer range 内一致。在 best 档下，cross-benchmark replication  被视为\n    strong evidence against task-specific overfitting。RSA peak 从 Goal L12  移到 Spatial\n    L14-15 的微小偏移被解读为 task-dependent modulation（不同空间推理需求 导致 slightly deeper processing），而非\n    inconsistency。p<0.001 的 bootstrap significance  排除了 random fluctuation。这一结果为 C1\n    framework 的跨任务适用性提供了 within-architecture  validation，补充 C2 的跨架构 validation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Cross-Benchmark Consistency (OpenVLA)\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - LIBERO-Goal\n    - LIBERO-Spatial\n    - Consistent?\n    rows:\n    - - RSA peak (trained img_mean)\n      - L12 (0.628)\n      - L14 (0.691)\n      - Yes (±2L)\n    - - R² peak (trained img_mean)\n      - L8 (0.655)\n      - L13 (0.696)\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - Untrained RSA peak\n      - L0 (0.612)\n      - L0 (0.652)\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - Training effect Δ (best-vs-best)\n      - '+0.017'\n      - '+0.023'\n      - Both sig.\n    - - Untrained last_pre collapse\n      - L10-L13\n      - L5-L31\n      - Both collapse\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Dual-panel line plot: Goal vs Spatial per-layer RSA and R² profiles overlaid'\n  analysis: '跨 benchmark 一致性确认 OpenVLA 内部的 representational pattern 不是 task-specific。\n    这为后续跨架构验证（TracVLA, NORA）提供了 within-architecture baseline。\n\n    '\n- name: Full-layer R² Scan\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: 33 layers × 2 conditions × 2 aggregations = 132 MLP action probes，获取\n    R² per-layer curve\n  expected_results:\n    trained_image_mean_peak:\n      layer: 8\n      mean_R2: 0.655\n    trained_last_preaction_peak:\n      layer: 13\n      mean_R2: 0.678\n    untrained_image_mean_peak:\n      layer: 0\n      mean_R2: 0.64\n    untrained_last_preaction_peak:\n      layer: 32\n      mean_R2: 0.609\n    projector_R2: 0.63\n    bootstrap_best_vs_best:\n      image_mean:\n        delta: 0.015\n        p: 0.006\n      last_preaction:\n        delta: 0.069\n        p: 0.0001\n    untrained_pathological_layers: L10-L13 R²≈0\n  result_rationale: 'R² per-layer curve 与 RSA inverted-U 一致，但揭示了 RSA 无法捕捉的关键差异： (1)\n    Trained last_preaction peak=0.678 > projector=0.630（p<0.001），说明 LLM  在 instruction-conditioned\n    token 位置确实增强了 action-decodability—— 这是 C2 routing 的 functional evidence； (2) Untrained\n    L10-L13 R²≈0（pathological collapse），说明 random LLM weights  在这些层创造了不可解码的表征——与 trained\n    的平滑 inverted-U 形成鲜明对比； (3) last_preaction 的 best-vs-best Δ=0.069（p<0.0001）远大于\n    image_mean Δ=0.015， 确认 training effect 集中在 instruction-conditioned token position。\n    在 best 档下，这一 R²-RSA convergence 被视为 metric-robust validation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: R² Per-layer Peak Summary\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - Token\n    - Peak Layer\n    - Peak R²\n    - Exit R²\n    - Δ(peak-exit)\n    rows:\n    - - Trained\n      - image_mean\n      - L8\n      - '0.655'\n      - 0.422*\n      - '0.233'\n    - - Trained\n      - last_preaction\n      - L13\n      - '0.678'\n      - '0.609'\n      - '0.069'\n    - - Untrained\n      - image_mean\n      - L0\n      - '0.640'\n      - 0.545*\n      - '0.095'\n    - - Untrained\n      - last_preaction\n      - L32\n      - '0.609'\n      - '0.609'\n      - '0.000'\n    - - Projector\n      - —\n      - —\n      - '0.630'\n      - —\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Dual-panel: image_mean and last_preaction R² per-layer curves, trained (solid)\n    vs untrained (dashed), with projector baseline horizontal line'\n  analysis: 'R² scan 是连接 C1（framework）和 C2（routing）的桥梁实验。image_mean 的 training  invariance（Δ=0.015,\n    small）支持 C1/C3；last_preaction 的 training effect  （Δ=0.069, p<0.0001）支持 C2 的 instruction\n    routing narrative。 这一 dissociation 本身是论文的核心 insight：training 不改变 vision geometry  但\n    reshape instruction routing。\n\n    '\n- name: CLIP-ViT Pretraining Control\n  plan_id: plan_012\n  description: 用 CLIP ViT-L/14 替代 SigLIP，区分 VL pretraining 贡献 vs encoder 本身质量\n  expected_results:\n    clip_cls_rsa: 0.557\n    clip_cls_R2: 0.587\n    dino_cls_rsa: 0.692\n    dino_cls_R2: 0.634\n    projector_R2: 0.63\n    ordering: last_preaction_L19 (0.671) > DINO (0.634) ≈ Projector (0.630) > image_mean_L19\n      (0.599) > CLIP (0.587)\n  result_rationale: 'CLIP RSA=0.557 和 R²=0.587 均低于 DINOv2（RSA=0.692, R²=0.634）， 否定了\n    \"VL pretraining 优于 self-supervised\" 的假说。在 best 档下， reviewers 接受这一结果说明 action-relevant\n    geometry 更多来自 spatial/temporal  feature quality（DINOv2 的 self-supervised 目标天然对齐）而非\n    language-grounding  能力（CLIP 的 contrastive objective 不直接服务 action prediction）。\n    这为 C3 的 DINOv2 ranking observation 提供了额外的 interpretive depth： DINOv2 的优势不是因为它\n    \"understand language\" 而是因为它的 patch-level  features 保留了更多 spatial-temporal structure。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Cross-Encoder Comparison (Unified Probe)\n    columns:\n    - Encoder\n    - RSA (ρ)\n    - Action R²\n    - Pretraining\n    rows:\n    - - DINOv2 cls\n      - '0.692'\n      - '0.634'\n      - Self-supervised (iBOT+DINO)\n    - - SigLIP+Proj\n      - '0.615'\n      - '0.630'\n      - VL contrastive\n    - - CLIP ViT-L cls\n      - '0.557'\n      - '0.587'\n      - VL contrastive\n    - - VLA last_pre L19\n      - —\n      - '0.671'\n      - VLA finetuned\n    - - VLA img_mean L19\n      - —\n      - '0.599'\n      - VLA finetuned\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Grouped bar: RSA and R² side by side for each encoder, DINOv2 dominant in RSA'\n  analysis: 'CLIP < DINO 在两个维度上成立。在 best 档下，这排除了 \"VL pretraining  is the key\" 解释，支持\n    \"spatial feature quality matters more than  language grounding for action prediction\"\n    的结论。\n\n    '\n- name: Branch-Split RSA\n  plan_id: plan_013\n  description: 在 DinoSigLIP fused backbone 中分离 DINOv2 branch (1088d) 和 SigLIP branch\n    (1088d) 的 RSA\n  expected_results:\n    dinov2_branch_rsa: 0.619\n    siglip_branch_rsa: 0.621\n    fused_2176d_rsa: 0.634\n    post_projector_4096d_rsa: 0.615\n    standalone_dino_cls_rsa: 0.692\n  result_rationale: 'DINOv2 branch (0.619) ≈ SigLIP branch (0.621)，Δ<0.002，说明在 fused\n    backbone  中两个分支贡献几乎相等。Fused=0.634 > either branch (complementary benefit)， projector\n    压缩 0.634→0.615（-0.019 的信息损失）。 Standalone DINO cls=0.692 > in-backbone DINOv2=0.619\n    的差异来自不同的 extraction layer  和 CLS vs patch-mean 的聚合方式差异。 在 best 档下，reviewers 接受\n    branch-split 分析作为 C3 observation 的 fine-grained  support：vision encoder 的两个分支互补而非冗余，projector\n    起到了 information bottleneck  的作用（轻微压缩但保持核心 structure）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Branch-Split RSA Analysis\n    columns:\n    - Representation\n    - Dim\n    - RSA (ρ)\n    - Δ vs Fused\n    rows:\n    - - DINOv2 branch (in-backbone)\n      - '1088'\n      - '0.619'\n      - '-0.015'\n    - - SigLIP branch (in-backbone)\n      - '1088'\n      - '0.621'\n      - '-0.013'\n    - - Fused backbone\n      - '2176'\n      - '0.634'\n      - —\n    - - Post-projector\n      - '4096'\n      - '0.615'\n      - '-0.019'\n    - - Standalone DINOv2 cls\n      - '1024'\n      - '0.692'\n      - '+0.058'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Waterfall chart: Fused (0.634) → Projector compression → LLM degradation → final\n    VLA layer'\n  analysis: '两分支等贡献 + projector 轻微压缩 + LLM 进一步降解 = 完整的 information flow 图。 在 best\n    档下，这是 C1 framework 的 architectural decomposition， 让 reviewers 看到 action-relevant\n    information 在每个 pipeline stage 的 fate。\n\n    '\n- name: Cross-Architecture R² Exit Collapse Matrix\n  plan_id: cross_arch_r2_collapse\n  description: 3 架构 × 4 suite 的 R² exit collapse 矩阵，验证 VLM→VLA 二元分离\n  expected_results:\n    vlm_to_vla_cells:\n      tracvla_goal:\n        trained_delta: 0.228\n        untrained_delta: 0.048\n        collapse: true\n      tracvla_spatial:\n        trained_delta: 0.138\n        untrained_delta: 0.016\n        collapse: true\n      tracvla_object:\n        trained_delta: 0.294\n        untrained_delta: 0.009\n        collapse: true\n      tracvla_long:\n        trained_delta: 0.198\n        untrained_delta: 0.028\n        collapse: true\n      nora_goal:\n        trained_delta: 0.691\n        untrained_delta: 0.044\n        collapse: true\n      nora_spatial:\n        trained_delta: 0.302\n        untrained_delta: 0.037\n        collapse: true\n    vla_to_vla_cells:\n      openvla_goal:\n        trained_delta: 0.016\n        untrained_delta: 0.033\n        collapse: false\n      openvla_spatial:\n        trained_delta: 0.037\n        untrained_delta: 0.034\n        collapse: false\n      openvla_object:\n        trained_delta: 0.037\n        untrained_delta: 0.076\n        collapse: false\n      openvla_long:\n        trained_delta: 0.004\n        untrained_delta: 0.016\n        collapse: false\n    binary_separation: 6/6 VLM→VLA collapse vs 0/4 VLA→VLA collapse\n    threshold: 0.1\n    nlp_control_delta: 0.0\n  result_rationale: 'R² exit collapse 在 VLM→VLA 转换中 6/6 一致出现（TracVLA Δ=0.138-0.294,\n    NORA Δ=0.302-0.691）， 在 VLA→VLA 转换中 0/4 出现（OpenVLA Δ=0.004-0.037, 全部 < 0.10 threshold）。\n    NLP finetuning control ΔR²=0.000 排除了 generic fine-tuning artifact。 在 best 档下，这一\n    clean binary separation 被 reviewers 视为 novel mechanistic insight： exit collapse\n    是 VLM→VLA transition 的 one-time representational reorganization， 反映了 action head\n    学习选择性丢弃 exit-layer action information 的过程。 一旦这个 reorganization 完成（OXE pretraining\n    阶段），进一步 task-specific finetuning  不再触发新的 collapse。Δ>0.10 threshold 基于 v3 MCCV（demo-level\n    cross-validation  修正了 v2 的 train-test leakage），reviewers 不视为 arbitrary 因为它将两类转换  完全分离。NORA\n    Goal 的 Δ=0.691 是最极端的 collapse，可能与 Qwen2.5-VL-3B  的较小模型容量有关（更多 information 被压缩到\n    exit 层）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'R² Exit Collapse: VLM→VLA vs VLA→VLA Binary Separation'\n    columns:\n    - Architecture\n    - Backbone\n    - Suite\n    - Transition Type\n    - Trained Δ\n    - Untrained Δ\n    - Collapse?\n    rows:\n    - - TracVLA\n      - Phi-3-mini\n      - Goal\n      - VLM→VLA\n      - '0.228'\n      - '0.048'\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - TracVLA\n      - Phi-3-mini\n      - Spatial\n      - VLM→VLA\n      - '0.138'\n      - '0.016'\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - TracVLA\n      - Phi-3-mini\n      - Object\n      - VLM→VLA\n      - '0.294'\n      - '0.009'\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - TracVLA\n      - Phi-3-mini\n      - Long\n      - VLM→VLA\n      - '0.198'\n      - '0.028'\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - NORA\n      - Qwen2.5-VL-3B\n      - Goal\n      - VLM→VLA\n      - '0.691'\n      - '0.044'\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - NORA\n      - Qwen2.5-VL-3B\n      - Spatial\n      - VLM→VLA\n      - '0.302'\n      - '0.037'\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - OpenVLA\n      - Llama-2-7B\n      - Goal\n      - VLA→VLA\n      - '0.016'\n      - '0.033'\n      - 'No'\n    - - OpenVLA\n      - Llama-2-7B\n      - Spatial\n      - VLA→VLA\n      - '0.037'\n      - '0.034'\n      - 'No'\n    - - OpenVLA\n      - Llama-2-7B\n      - Object\n      - VLA→VLA\n      - '0.037'\n      - '0.076'\n      - 'No'\n    - - OpenVLA\n      - Llama-2-7B\n      - Long (OFT)\n      - VLA→VLA\n      - '0.004'\n      - '0.016'\n      - 'No'\n    - - NLP Control\n      - Llama-2-7B\n      - —\n      - LLM→Chat\n      - '0.000'\n      - —\n      - 'No'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Grouped bar chart: Trained Δ(peak-exit) for each cell, color-coded by transition\n    type. Clear visual separation between VLM→VLA (tall bars) and VLA→VLA (flat bars).'\n  - 'Scatter plot: Trained Δ on x-axis, colored by transition type, showing perfect\n    linear separation at Δ=0.10'\n  analysis: '6/6 vs 0/4 + NLP control ΔR²=0.000 形成论文最强的跨架构 finding。 在 best 档下 (exit_collapse_reviewer_acceptance:\n    0.85-1.0)， reviewers 接受这是 VLA training 的 emergent property， 而非特定架构或任务的 artifact。\n\n    '\n- name: Cross-Architecture Counterfactual Sensitivity\n  plan_id: cross_arch_cf\n  description: 3 架构 × 4 suite 的 counterfactual perturbation 分析\n  expected_results:\n    openvla_same_metric_comparisons:\n      goal:\n        trained_d: 1.182\n        untrained_d: 1.048\n        delta: 0.134\n        metric: cohen_d\n      spatial:\n        trained_d: 1.173\n        untrained_d: 0.936\n        delta: 0.237\n        metric: cohen_d\n    tracvla_trained_d_range:\n    - 1.17\n    - 1.52\n    tracvla_untrained_cos_range:\n    - 0.153\n    - 0.185\n    nora_trained: cos=1.0 (saturated)\n    nora_untrained_cos: 0.081\n    metric_incomparability_count: 5/8 cross-arch cells\n  result_rationale: 'CF sensitivity 一致存在于所有 trained VLAs（Cohen''s d ≥ 0.45 across\n    all tested conditions）， 但 metric incomparability 限制了跨条件定量比较。在 best 档下，reviewers\n    接受： (1) OpenVLA 是唯一可做公平 trained-vs-untrained 比较的架构（两个条件都能生成 actions， 用同一 Cohen''s\n    d metric），结果 trained 高于 untrained 但 gap 适中（Δ=0.04-0.24）， 因为 OXE-pretrained untrained\n    已是训练过的 VLA； (2) TracVLA/NORA 的 trained 用 d（action space），untrained 用 cos（hidden\n    space）， 两者不可比，但论文 properly caveat 这一点而非 overclaim； (3) \"empty\" 在 6/8 trained settings\n    排第一（最大 perturbation = 完全移除 instruction）， 这一 consistent ordering 跨架构成立，支持 instruction\n    routing 的 functional 解读。 CF sensitivity reviewer acceptance 在 best 档为 70-90%——部分\n    reviewers  可能对 metric incomparability 有保留，但 proper caveating 化解了大多数担忧。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Counterfactual Sensitivity: Fair Comparisons (OpenVLA, same metric)'\n    columns:\n    - Suite\n    - Trained top d\n    - Untrained top d\n    - Δ\n    - Trained top condition\n    rows:\n    - - Goal\n      - 1.182 (wrong)\n      - 1.048 (empty)\n      - '+0.134'\n      - wrong\n    - - Spatial\n      - 1.173 (empty)\n      - 0.936 (empty)\n      - '+0.237'\n      - empty\n    - - Object\n      - 1.210 (empty)\n      - cos=0.569*\n      - incommensurable\n      - empty\n    - - Long (OFT)\n      - 0.565 (shuffled)\n      - —\n      - —\n      - shuffled\n  - title: 'Counterfactual Sensitivity: Cross-Architecture (trained only)'\n    columns:\n    - Architecture\n    - Suite\n    - Top d/cos\n    - Top Condition\n    - Metric\n    rows:\n    - - OpenVLA\n      - Goal\n      - d=1.182\n      - wrong\n      - Cohen's d\n    - - OpenVLA\n      - Spatial\n      - d=1.173\n      - empty\n      - Cohen's d\n    - - TracVLA\n      - Goal\n      - d=1.524\n      - empty\n      - Cohen's d\n    - - TracVLA\n      - Spatial\n      - d=1.327\n      - empty\n      - Cohen's d\n    - - TracVLA\n      - Object\n      - d=1.212\n      - empty\n      - Cohen's d\n    - - TracVLA\n      - Long\n      - d=1.473\n      - empty\n      - Cohen's d\n    - - NORA\n      - Goal\n      - cos=1.0\n      - saturated\n      - cosine dist\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Heatmap: architecture × suite, cell color = Cohen''s d magnitude, with metric\n    type annotation'\n  analysis: 'CF sensitivity 的跨架构一致性支持 C2 routing narrative。在 best 档下， metric incomparability\n    被 properly caveated 后不构成 fatal objection， 因为 OpenVLA 的 within-metric comparison\n    已足够作为 fair evidence。\n\n    '\n- name: Three-Tier Routing Gradient\n  plan_id: three_tier_gradient\n  description: VLM base → OXE-pretrained VLA → task-finetuned VLA 的三层级 routing 梯度验证\n  expected_results:\n    tier1_vlm_base:\n      r2_exit_collapse: None (0/2)\n      cf_sensitivity: cos < 0.2 (TracVLA/NORA untrained)\n      l1_heads: 'base-model-dependent (Phi-3: 32/32, Qwen: 13/16)'\n    tier2_oxe_pretrained:\n      r2_exit_collapse: None (0/4 OpenVLA cells < 0.10)\n      cf_sensitivity: d=1.048 (strong, same metric comparison)\n      l1_heads: 25/32 (OpenVLA untrained)\n    tier3_task_finetuned:\n      r2_exit_collapse: 6/6 VLM→VLA cells > 0.10\n      cf_sensitivity: d ≥ 1.17 (TracVLA/NORA trained)\n      l1_heads: architecture-dependent (22-30/32)\n    routing_progression: No routing → General routing (OXE) → Task-specific routing\n      (LIBERO)\n  result_rationale: '三层级梯度是论文的 narrative spine。在 best 档下，reviewers 接受这一 staged  emergence\n    story：(1) VLM base（Phi-3-Vision, Qwen2.5-VL）无 action training， 无 exit collapse，CF\n    sensitivity 极低（cos<0.2），L1 heads 完全来自语言预训练； (2) OXE-pretrained VLA（openvla-7b,\n    970K episodes）已有强 L1 routing（25/32 heads）， 强 CF（d=1.048），但无 exit collapse——说明\n    OXE training 创建了 routing  但尚未触发 exit-layer reorganization； (3) Task-finetuned\n    VLA（TracVLA/NORA）在 VLM→VLA 转换时触发 exit collapse， CF sensitivity 进一步增强，h13/h22 mixed\n    heads emerge (TracVLA)。 关键区分：L1 head count 是 base-model-dependent（Phi-3 的 instruction\n    tuning  已创建 32/32 heads，训练反而减少到 27-30/32），而 R² collapse 和 CF sensitivity  是 training-induced。这一\n    honest distinction 在 best 档下被视为  methodological sophistication，而非 weakness。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Three-Tier Routing Gradient\n    columns:\n    - Tier\n    - Example\n    - R² Collapse\n    - CF Sensitivity\n    - L1 Heads\n    - Routing\n    rows:\n    - - 'Tier 1: VLM base'\n      - Phi-3-Vision\n      - None\n      - cos<0.2\n      - 32/32 (pretrained)\n      - Language-only\n    - - 'Tier 1: VLM base'\n      - Qwen2.5-VL\n      - None\n      - cos=0.081\n      - 13/16 (pretrained)\n      - Language-only\n    - - 'Tier 2: OXE VLA'\n      - openvla-7b\n      - None (Δ<0.10)\n      - d=1.048\n      - 25/32\n      - General action\n    - - 'Tier 3: Task VLA'\n      - TracVLA-Goal\n      - Δ=0.228\n      - d=1.524\n      - 27/32\n      - Task-specific\n    - - 'Tier 3: Task VLA'\n      - NORA-Goal\n      - Δ=0.691\n      - cos=1.0*\n      - 13/16\n      - Task-specific\n    - - 'Control: NLP'\n      - Llama-2-chat\n      - ΔR²=0.000\n      - N/A\n      - N/A\n      - None (language only)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Schematic: three tiers as pipeline stages, each tier annotated with R² collapse\n    status, CF magnitude, and L1 head count'\n  analysis: '三层级梯度将 exit collapse、CF sensitivity、L1 heads 统一在一个 developmental narrative\n    中。 在 best 档下，这是论文从 \"observation collection\" 升级到 \"mechanistic story\" 的关键。\n\n    '\n- name: NLP Finetuning Control\n  plan_id: nlp_control\n  description: Llama-2-7b-chat（SFT+RLHF）+ Phi-3-mini-instruct + Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct\n    的 R² profile，排除 generic finetuning artifact\n  expected_results:\n    llama2_chat:\n      mean_r2: 0.1553\n      r2_range:\n      - 0.1547\n      - 0.1555\n      delta_r2: 0.0\n      profile: flat constant across all 32 layers\n    phi3_instruct:\n      mean_r2: 0.1555\n      r2_range:\n      - 0.1552\n      - 0.1555\n      delta_r2: 0.0\n    qwen25_instruct:\n      mean_r2: 0.1554\n      r2_range:\n      - 0.155\n      - 0.1555\n      delta_r2: 0.0\n    interpretation: R² ≈ 0.155 is noise floor; NLP finetuning creates zero layer-differentiated\n      action representation\n  result_rationale: '三个 NLP-finetuned models 在所有层 R²≈0.155（noise floor，仅拟合 between-task\n    variance）， ΔR²=0.000。对比同 backbone 的 VLM→VLA 转换：TracVLA Δ=0.156-0.294，NORA Δ=0.302-0.691。\n    在 best 档下（A6 假设），reviewers 接受这是 strong evidence 排除 \"exit collapse  is a generic\n    fine-tuning artifact\"。逻辑链：(1) 同 backbone（Llama-2-7B）+  不同 finetuning（NLP chat\n    vs VLA action）= 只有 VLA 产生 exit collapse； (2) 不同 backbone（Llama-2, Phi-3, Qwen2.5）+\n    同 finetuning 类型（NLP instruction tuning） = 三个都没有 exit collapse。这双重排除了 backbone-specific\n    和 finetuning-generic 两种  alternative explanations。R²=0.155 的物理含义是 ridge regression\n    只从 between-task  variance（10 classes → ~10% base + inter-task feature differences）中拟合，\n    无 layer-specific action information。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'NLP Finetuning Control: R² Exit Collapse Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Backbone\n    - Finetuning\n    - Peak R²\n    - Exit R²\n    - ΔR²\n    rows:\n    - - Llama-2-7b-chat\n      - Llama-2-7B\n      - SFT+RLHF (NLP)\n      - '0.1555'\n      - '0.1555'\n      - '0.000'\n    - - Phi-3-mini-instruct\n      - Phi-3-mini\n      - Instruction tuning (NLP)\n      - '0.1555'\n      - '0.1555'\n      - '0.000'\n    - - Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct\n      - Qwen2.5-3B\n      - Instruction tuning (NLP)\n      - '0.1555'\n      - '0.1555'\n      - '0.000'\n    - - TracVLA (trained)\n      - Phi-3-mini\n      - VLA (VLM→VLA)\n      - '0.839'\n      - '0.574'\n      - 0.265*\n    - - NORA (trained)\n      - Qwen2.5-VL-3B\n      - VLA (VLM→VLA)\n      - '0.697'\n      - '-0.004'\n      - 0.701*\n    - - OpenVLA (trained)\n      - Llama-2-7B\n      - VLA (VLA→VLA)\n      - '0.869'\n      - '0.853'\n      - '0.016'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Per-layer R² plot: three NLP controls as flat lines at 0.155, overlaid with VLA\n    trained curves showing inverted-U + exit collapse'\n  analysis: 'NLP control 是论文的 specificity killshot。在 best 档下， 这一三 backbone 一致的 null\n    result 让 \"generic finetuning\"  和 \"backbone-specific\" 两种 alternative explanations\n    同时被排除。\n\n    '\n- name: L1 Instruction-Dominant Head Analysis (Cross-Architecture)\n  plan_id: cross_arch_l1_heads\n  description: 三架构 × 多 suite 的 L1 attention head 分析，区分 training-induced vs base-model-dependent\n  expected_results:\n    openvla:\n      trained_goal: 23\n      untrained_goal: 26\n      trained_object: 24\n      untrained_object: 24\n      interpretation: OXE pretraining 已创建 routing; finetuning 减少 heads (→mixed)\n    tracvla:\n      trained_range:\n      - 27\n      - 30\n      untrained_all: 32\n      interpretation: Phi-3-Vision 32/32; training 减少到 27-30 (repurpose)\n    nora:\n      trained_goal: 13\n      untrained_goal: 13\n      trained_spatial: 12\n      untrained_spatial: 14\n      interpretation: Qwen2.5-VL 预训练已 13/16\n  result_rationale: 'L1 head count 的跨架构比较清楚地表明这是 base-model-dependent 而非 training-induced：\n    TracVLA untrained（纯 Phi-3-Vision）已 32/32 instruction-dominant，训练反而减少到 27-30/32；\n    NORA trained ≈ untrained（13/16 vs 13-14/16）；OpenVLA untrained（OXE pretrained）\n    已 25-26/32。在 best 档下（A5 假设），reviewers 将 \"what training creates vs  what it inherits\"\n    的区分视为 honest science——论文不 overclaim L1 heads 是训练效果， 而是准确归因为 base model 的语言预训练\n    attention pattern。 这种 intellectual honesty 提升而非降低论文的可信度。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'L1 Instruction-Dominant Heads: Training vs Inheritance'\n    columns:\n    - Architecture\n    - Backbone\n    - Suite\n    - Trained\n    - Untrained\n    - Δ\n    - Source\n    rows:\n    - - OpenVLA\n      - Llama-2-7B\n      - Goal\n      - 23/32\n      - 26/32 (OXE)\n      - '-3'\n      - Base+OXE\n    - - OpenVLA\n      - Llama-2-7B\n      - Object\n      - 24/32\n      - 24/32 (OXE)\n      - '0'\n      - Base+OXE\n    - - TracVLA\n      - Phi-3-mini\n      - Goal\n      - 27/32\n      - 32/32 (VLM)\n      - '-5'\n      - Base VLM\n    - - TracVLA\n      - Phi-3-mini\n      - Object\n      - 30/32\n      - 32/32 (VLM)\n      - '-2'\n      - Base VLM\n    - - NORA\n      - Qwen2.5-VL\n      - Goal\n      - 13/16\n      - 13/16 (VLM)\n      - '0'\n      - Base VLM\n    - - NORA\n      - Qwen2.5-VL\n      - Spatial\n      - 12/16\n      - 14/16 (VLM)\n      - '-2'\n      - Base VLM\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Paired bar: trained vs untrained L1 heads per architecture, showing that untrained\n    ≥ trained in most cases'\n  analysis: 'Training 不增加 L1 heads——在多数情况下反而减少（repurpose some heads to mixed function）。\n    在 best 档下，这一 counter-intuitive finding 被视为 nuanced insight， 强化了论文区分 training effect\n    和 inherited property 的贡献。\n\n    '\n- name: Cross-Instruction Probe (Dense Layer Profile)\n  plan_id: cross_inst_probe\n  description: 10-way instruction classification × 33 layers × 3 conditions（trained/untrained/Llama-2\n    base），验证 instruction routing 的逐层 dynamics\n  expected_results:\n    trained_last_preaction:\n      L0: 0.1\n      L1: 0.996\n      L2_to_L32: 1.0\n      pattern: immediate routing — L1 saturates\n    llama2base_last_preaction:\n      L0: 0.1\n      L1: 0.802\n      L2: 0.987\n      L5_plus: 1.0\n      pattern: gradual buildup — saturates at L5\n    untrained_last_preaction:\n      L0: 0.1\n      L1: 1.0\n      L8: 0.986\n      L16: 0.923\n      L24: 0.864\n      L31: 0.82\n      pattern: accidental routing + gradual forgetting\n    image_mean_all_conditions: 0.1\n    loocv_trained: 100.00±0.00\n    loocv_untrained: 96.64±7.07 → 84.76±11.59\n  result_rationale: '三条件的 cross-instruction probe 揭示了三种定性不同的 routing 策略： (1) Trained\n    在 L1 即达 99.6% → 全程 100%——VLA training 创建了 immediate dedicated routing， instruction\n    identity 在第一层就被提取并全程保持； (2) Llama-2 base 从 L1=80.2% 逐渐升至 L5=100%——语言预训练创建了 gradual\n    processing， instruction 需要多层处理才能被 fully resolve，但一旦 resolve 就稳定保持； (3) Untrained（random\n    init）L1=100% 看似最好，但 L31=82%——\"偶然路由\"因 high-dim  random features 的 trivial separability\n    在 L1 成功，但 random weight 的 noise accumulation  导致 signal 逐层衰减。 Image_mean 在所有条件下都是\n    10%（chance），确认 causal mask 阻止了 image→instruction  information flow。在 best 档下，这一\n    three-way comparison 是 C2 的 definitive evidence， 展示了 VLA training 的 unique contribution（immediacy\n    + stability）vs pretrained  language processing（gradual + stable）vs random baseline（accidental\n    + decaying）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Cross-Instruction Classification: Three Routing Strategies'\n    columns:\n    - Layer\n    - VLA Trained\n    - Llama-2 Base\n    - Untrained (Random)\n    - Image Mean (all)\n    rows:\n    - - L0\n      - 10%\n      - 10%\n      - 10%\n      - 10%\n    - - L1\n      - 99.6%\n      - 80.2%\n      - 100%\n      - 10%\n    - - L2\n      - 100%\n      - 98.7%\n      - 100%\n      - 10%\n    - - L5\n      - 100%\n      - 100%\n      - 99.x%\n      - 10%\n    - - L8\n      - 100%\n      - 100%\n      - 98.6%\n      - 10%\n    - - L16\n      - 100%\n      - 100%\n      - 92.3%\n      - 10%\n    - - L24\n      - 100%\n      - 100%\n      - 86.4%\n      - 10%\n    - - L31\n      - 100%\n      - 100%\n      - 82.0%\n      - 10%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Three-line plot: instruction classification accuracy across 33 layers. Trained=flat\n    at 100%, Llama-2 base=rising to 100% by L5, Untrained=declining from 100% to 82%'\n  analysis: '三条件 probe profile 是论文最 visually compelling 的 figure 之一。 在 best 档下，reviewers\n    一眼就能看到 three qualitatively different strategies， 这是 C2 claim \"VLA fine-tuning\n    achieves immediate dedicated routing\" 的 direct evidence。\n\n    '\n- name: L1 Attention Three-Condition Profile\n  plan_id: l1_attention_three_cond\n  description: L1 attention pattern 的 untrained/Llama-2 base/VLA trained 三条件对比\n  expected_results:\n    untrained:\n      text_attention: 0.117\n      image_attention: 0.878\n      instruction_dominant_heads: 0\n    llama2base:\n      text_attention: 0.365\n      image_attention: 0.617\n      instruction_dominant_heads: 9\n    trained:\n      text_attention: 0.577\n      image_attention: 0.213\n      instruction_dominant_heads: 24\n    per_token_normalized_ratio:\n      trained_instr_dom: 38.2\n      untrained: 1.5\n      training_amplification: 25.5\n  result_rationale: 'L1 attention 的三条件梯度（0→9→24 instruction-dominant heads, 12%→37%→58%\n    text attention） 是 C2 的 mechanistic evidence。Per-token normalization（考虑 ~11.5x\n    image/text  token count asymmetry）后，trained instruction-dominant heads 的 text/image\n    ratio  达 38.2x（vs untrained 1.5x），说明 training 创建了 extreme instruction specialization。\n    在 best 档下，这一 gradient 与 cross-instruction probe 的 three strategies  在 mechanistic\n    level 对应：(1) untrained 0 heads → 无 instruction processing capacity； (2) Llama-2\n    base 9 heads → 中等语言处理能力（mid-layer inverted-U）； (3) VLA trained 24 heads → immediate\n    instruction capture（L1 saturated probe）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'L1 Attention Pattern: Three-Condition Gradient'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Untrained\n    - Llama-2 Base\n    - VLA Trained\n    rows:\n    - - Attention to text/instruction\n      - 11.7%\n      - 36.5%\n      - 57.7%\n    - - Attention to image\n      - 87.8%\n      - 61.7%\n      - 21.3%\n    - - Instruction-dominant heads (>50%)\n      - 0/32\n      - 9/32\n      - 24/32\n    - - Per-token text/image ratio\n      - 1.5x\n      - —\n      - 38.2x\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Stacked bar or pie charts: attention distribution at L1 for three conditions'\n  analysis: '0→9→24 gradient 是 C2 headline finding 的 most concise summary。 在 best\n    档下，per-token normalization 排除了 token-count confound， strengthening the claim that\n    training creates genuine instruction specialization。\n\n    '\n- name: 32-Layer Dense Attention Profile\n  plan_id: dense_attention_profile\n  description: 全 32 层 × 三条件的 instruction-dominant head count profile\n  expected_results:\n    untrained_pattern: 0 heads at all 32 layers — no language processing capacity\n    llama2base_pattern: Inverted-U — L0-L4 low (0-10) → L9-L16 peak (15-22) → L31\n      decline (8)\n    trained_pattern: Bookend — L0-L1 peak (21-24) → L2-L30 valley (0-11) → L31 re-engagement\n      (18)\n  result_rationale: 'Dense 32-layer profile 是 C2 的 strongest mechanistic evidence：\n    VLA training 将 instruction attention 从 Llama-2 base 的 mid-layer processing  模式（inverted-U,\n    peak L9-L16）reorganize 到 bookend 模式（entry L0-L1 + exit L31）。 这一 temporal reorganization\n    与 cross-instruction probe 在 functional level 一致： trained model 在 entry 层 capture\n    instruction（L1=99.6%）并在 exit 层 re-engage  for action conditioning（L31 18 heads）。\n    在 best 档下，bookend pattern 被解读为 efficient routing architecture： entry 层 extract\n    instruction identity，mid-layers 用于 vision-dominated computation， exit 层 re-inject\n    instruction signal for action generation。 Llama-2 base 的 inverted-U 是经典 LM pattern（mid-layer\n    deep semantic processing）， VLA training 保留了总体 attention capacity 但 redistribute\n    了 temporal allocation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Dense Attention Profile: Representative Layers'\n    columns:\n    - Layer\n    - Untrained\n    - Llama-2 Base\n    - VLA Trained\n    - Trained Pattern\n    rows:\n    - - L0\n      - '0'\n      - '2'\n      - '21'\n      - Entry peak\n    - - L1\n      - '0'\n      - '4'\n      - '24'\n      - Entry peak\n    - - L4\n      - '0'\n      - '8'\n      - '5'\n      - Valley\n    - - L9\n      - '0'\n      - '18'\n      - '3'\n      - Valley\n    - - L12\n      - '0'\n      - '22'\n      - '1'\n      - Valley\n    - - L16\n      - '0'\n      - '20'\n      - '4'\n      - Valley\n    - - L24\n      - '0'\n      - '12'\n      - '7'\n      - Valley\n    - - L31\n      - '0'\n      - '8'\n      - '18'\n      - Exit re-engagement\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Three-panel line plot: instruction-dominant head count across 32 layers for each\n    condition. Bookend vs inverted-U vs flat-zero patterns clearly distinguishable.'\n  analysis: 'Mid-layer inverted-U → bookend reorganization 是论文的 narrative centerpiece。\n    在 best 档下，这一 visualization 是 Figure 1 或 Figure 2 的核心 panel， 让 reviewers 直观理解 VLA\n    training 的 routing reorganization。\n\n    '\n- name: Counterfactual Action Trajectory Analysis (OpenVLA)\n  plan_id: cf_trajectory_analysis\n  description: L1 head ablation 对 action output 的影响：Cohen's d, MSE, token divergence,\n    GT error\n  expected_results:\n    head_ablation_top24:\n      cohens_d: 0.651\n      trajectory_d: 2.943\n      paired_mse: 0.042\n      token_divergence: 0.723\n      delta_gt_mse: -0.001\n    specificity_ratio: 1.08\n    gt_error_delta: ΔMSE ≈ 0 (p=0.519)\n    token_overlap_spearman: 1.0\n  result_rationale: 'Ablating 24 instruction-dominant heads 在 L1 产生 d=0.651 的 action\n    shift， trajectory level d=2.943（~4.5x inflation due to within-trajectory correlation）。\n    关键 finding：ΔMSE_vs_GT ≈ 0（p=0.519），说明 ablation redirects action outputs  without\n    degrading accuracy。在 best 档下，这一 information-computation dissociation  被解读为 instruction\n    heads 控制 action direction（哪个 action space region） 而非 action quality（与 ground truth\n    的距离）。 Specificity ratio 1.08x（instruction 24 heads vs random 24 heads）modest，\n    但 per-head analysis 显示 control heads 有 ~1.9x per-head effect， instruction heads\n    通过 24-head collective coordination 产生更大 total effect。 Token overlap Spearman ρ=1.0\n    确认 CF sensitivity 与 lexical/positional novelty  而非 semantic distance 相关——这是 honest\n    caveat，论文不 overclaim semantic processing。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Counterfactual Action Analysis\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Instruction 24h Ablation\n    - Control 8h Ablation\n    - Ratio\n    rows:\n    - - Cohen's d (token)\n      - '0.651'\n      - '0.410'\n      - '1.59'\n    - - Trajectory d\n      - '2.943'\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - Paired MSE\n      - '0.042'\n      - '0.020'\n      - '2.07'\n    - - Token divergence\n      - '0.723'\n      - '0.293'\n      - '2.47'\n    - - KL divergence\n      - '5.079'\n      - '1.690'\n      - '3.00'\n    - - GT MSE delta\n      - -0.001 (n.s.)\n      - +0.008 (n.s.)\n      - —\n    - - Per-head d\n      - '0.027'\n      - '0.051'\n      - '0.53'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Dual panel: (A) token-level d comparison instruction vs control, (B) GT MSE showing\n    no degradation'\n  analysis: 'ΔMSE≈0 是 C2 的关键 evidence for information-computation dissociation。 在\n    best 档下，reviewers 接受 \"open-loop functional sensitivity\" framing—— instruction\n    heads modulate output direction without systematic quality change。\n\n    '\n- name: Training Trajectory (4-condition)\n  plan_id: training_trajectory\n  description: untrained → llama2base → bridge-vla → libero-finetuned 的 L1 attention\n    和 probe 演化轨迹\n  expected_results:\n    l1_heads_progression:\n      untrained: 0\n      llama2base: 9\n      bridge_vla: 24\n      libero_finetuned: 22\n    l31_exit_engagement:\n      bridge_vla: 18\n      libero_finetuned: 0\n    probe_accuracy_L31:\n      bridge_vla: 1.0\n      libero_finetuned: 1.0\n    attention_representation_dissociation: true\n  result_rationale: '4-condition trajectory 展示 routing 的 developmental history： (1)\n    Entry routing 在 OXE pretraining 时 emerge（0→24 heads），task finetuning  略减（24→22）但基本稳定；\n    (2) Exit engagement L31 从 bridge-vla 的 18 heads 到 libero-finetuned 的 0 heads——\n    entry-exit bookend → entry-only sharpening； (3) Probe accuracy 在 L31 保持 100%（两个条件都是），确认\n    attention-representation  dissociation：exit attention 消失但 representational capacity\n    不变。 在 best 档下，这一 dissociation 被视为 refinement 而非 contradiction—— LIBERO finetuning\n    sharpens routing to entry-only while maintaining representational  capacity at\n    exit through residual stream。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Training Trajectory: 4-Condition L1 Evolution'\n    columns:\n    - Stage\n    - L1 Heads\n    - L31 Heads\n    - L31 Probe Acc\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - Random init\n      - 0/32\n      - 0/32\n      - 82%\n      - No routing\n    - - Llama-2 base\n      - 9/32\n      - 8/32\n      - 100%\n      - Language processing\n    - - OXE-pretrained (bridge)\n      - 24/32\n      - 18/32\n      - 100%\n      - Bookend routing\n    - - LIBERO-finetuned\n      - 22/32\n      - 0/32\n      - 100%\n      - Entry-only sharpening\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Developmental timeline: L1 and L31 head counts across four training stages'\n  analysis: 'Attention-representation dissociation at L31 是 subtle but important finding。\n    在 best 档下，reviewers 接受这是 training 的 efficiency optimization： 从 bookend 到 entry-only，因为\n    residual stream 已足够 maintain information。\n\n    '\n- name: TracVLA Universal Mixed Heads (h13, h22)\n  plan_id: tracvla_mixed_heads\n  description: TracVLA 中 h13 和 h22 在全部 4 suites 的 trained 模型中一致作为 mixed head 出现\n  expected_results:\n    h13_status_all_suites: mixed (non-instruction-dominant, non-image-dominant)\n    h22_status_all_suites: mixed\n    untrained_mixed_heads: none (32/32 instruction-dominant)\n    consistency: 4/4 suites\n  result_rationale: 'h13 和 h22 在 TracVLA 的全部 4 个 LIBERO suite 中一致从 instruction-dominant  变为\n    mixed，而 untrained（Phi-3-Vision）无此 pattern（32/32 全 instruction-dominant）。 在 best\n    档下，这被解读为 training 创建了 functionally specialized mixed-modality heads—— 这些 heads\n    可能负责 cross-modal integration（同时处理 image 和 instruction information）， 而非单一 modality\n    的 routing。跨 suite 一致性排除了 task-specific artifact。 论文不 overclaim 具体功能（\"may perform\n    cross-modal integration\"）， 这种 measured language 在 best 档下被视为 appropriate caution。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: TracVLA Mixed Heads Across Suites\n    columns:\n    - Suite\n    - Trained Instr-Dom\n    - Trained Mixed\n    - Untrained Instr-Dom\n    - h13 Status\n    - h22 Status\n    rows:\n    - - Goal\n      - 27/32\n      - '5'\n      - 32/32\n      - mixed\n      - mixed\n    - - Spatial\n      - 30/32\n      - '2'\n      - 32/32\n      - mixed\n      - mixed\n    - - Object\n      - 30/32\n      - '2'\n      - 32/32\n      - mixed\n      - mixed\n    - - Long\n      - 30/32\n      - '2'\n      - 32/32\n      - mixed\n      - mixed\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Head-level attention heatmap: 32 heads × 4 suites, h13 and h22 highlighted as\n    consistently mixed'\n  analysis: Universal mixed heads 是 TracVLA-specific observation，补充 C2 的 cross-architecture\n    narrative。 在 best 档下，这是 interesting finding 但不是 core claim 的依赖项。\n","numLines":1754,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1754}}}
