{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ByKmde7H4BYZNKNDvMskaG","type":"tool_result","content":"# CoRL 2023 Review Form Details\n\nBased on the provided content, I cannot extract the complete review form details you requested. The document outlines **review writing guidelines** and **evaluation dimensions** but does not include the specific numerical scales.\n\n## Available Information:\n\nThe guidelines specify reviewers should evaluate papers on six dimensions:\n\n- **Originality**: Novel problems, methods, or combinations\n- **Quality**: Technical soundness and support for claims\n- **Clarity**: Writing quality and organization\n- **Significance**: Importance and advancement of the field\n- **Relevance**: Connection to robot learning and CoRL audience\n- **Limitations**: \"CoRL papers are required to include a limitations section\"\n\n## Missing Details:\n\nThe document does not provide:\n- Numerical rating scales (e.g., 1-10, 1-5)\n- Specific score descriptions for each rating level\n- Overall recommendation scale values\n- Confidence scale specifications\n\nTo obtain the complete review form with exact scales and descriptions, you would need to access the **OpenReview system directly** or contact the program chairs at the provided email address."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1daec3f0-5eda-4fd1-9945-e0c719d586e4","uuid":"5f385c44-be9b-42e7-b426-829c05cfa002","timestamp":"2026-05-27T03:17:20.245Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":105095,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# CoRL 2023 Review Form Details\n\nBased on the provided content, I cannot extract the complete review form details you requested. The document outlines **review writing guidelines** and **evaluation dimensions** but does not include the specific numerical scales.\n\n## Available Information:\n\nThe guidelines specify reviewers should evaluate papers on six dimensions:\n\n- **Originality**: Novel problems, methods, or combinations\n- **Quality**: Techn